#: ../../library/turtle.rst:3
msgid ":mod:`!turtle` --- Turtle graphics"
msgstr ":mod:`!turtle` --- 海龜繪圖 (Turtle graphics)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:8
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/turtle.py`"
msgstr "**原始碼：**\\ :source:`Lib/turtle.py`"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:29
msgid ""
"Turtle can draw intricate shapes using programs that repeat simple moves."
msgstr "海龜可以透過重複簡單動作的程式，畫出複雜的形狀。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:32
msgid "A yellow starburst of thin spikes with a red outline, drawn by turtle."
msgstr "海龜畫出的黃色星芒，由許多細長的尖角組成，外框是紅色的。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:36
msgid ""
"Imagine a robotic turtle starting at (0, 0) in the x-y plane. After an "
"``import turtle``, give it the command ``turtle.forward(15)``, and it moves "
"(on-screen!) 15 pixels in the direction it is facing, drawing a line as it "
"moves. Give it the command ``turtle.right(25)``, and it rotates in-place 25 "
"degrees clockwise."
msgstr ""
"想像一隻機器海龜從 x-y 平面上的 (0, 0) 出發。在 ``import turtle`` 之後，對它"
"下達 ``turtle.forward(15)`` 指令，它就會（在螢幕上！）朝著它面對的方向移動 "
"15 個像素，並在移動時畫出一條線。再對它下達 ``turtle.right(25)`` 指令，它就會"
"原地順時針旋轉 25 度。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:42
msgid ""
"Turtle graphics is an implementation of `the drawing tools introduced in "
"Logo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turtle_(robot)>`__ in 1967. It was "
"created as an educational tool, and its instant, visible feedback makes it "
"an effective way for learners to encounter programming concepts. It is also "
"a convenient way to produce simple graphical output without bringing in "
"external libraries."
msgstr ""
"海龜繪圖是 `Logo 於 1967 年引入的繪圖工具 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Turtle_(robot)>`__\\ 的一種實作。它原本是作為教育工具而設計的，即時且看得見的"
"回饋讓學習者能有效地接觸程式設計的概念。它也是一種不需引入外部函式庫，就能方"
"便地產生簡單圖形輸出的方式。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:48
msgid "This document includes four main sections:"
msgstr "此文件包含四個主要章節："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:50
msgid ":ref:`turtle-tutorial` teaches the basics of turtle drawing."
msgstr ":ref:`turtle-tutorial`\\ 教你海龜繪圖的基礎。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:51
msgid ""
":ref:`turtle-reference` describes the functions, methods and classes this "
"module defines."
msgstr ":ref:`turtle-reference`\\ 說明此模組定義的函式、方法與類別。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:53
msgid ":ref:`turtle-howtos` detail how to handle specific tasks."
msgstr ":ref:`turtle-howtos`\\ 詳細說明如何處理特定任務。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:54
msgid ""
":ref:`turtle-explanation` provides background on the object-oriented "
"interface."
msgstr ":ref:`turtle-explanation`\\ 提供物件導向介面的背景知識。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:59
msgid ""
"Turtle graphics requires the :mod:`tkinter` :term:`optional module`. The "
"python.org installers for Windows and macOS include it, but some Linux "
"distributions and other platforms may package it separately. If ``import "
"turtle`` fails with an error mentioning ``_tkinter``, look for documentation "
"from your distributor (that is, whoever provided Python to you). Check this "
"in advance if you're planning to use turtle graphics with a learner."
msgstr ""
"海龜繪圖需要 :mod:`tkinter` 這個\\ :term:`可選模組 <optional module>`。"
"python.org 提供的 Windows 和 macOS 安裝程式都有包含它，但某些 Linux 發行版和"
"其他平台可能會將它分開打包。如果 ``import turtle`` 失敗，並出現提及 "
"``_tkinter`` 的錯誤，請查閱你的發行者（也就是提供你 Python 的人）的文件。如果"
"你打算和學習者一起使用海龜繪圖，請事先確認這一點。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:72
msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "教學"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:74
msgid ""
"New users should start here. In this tutorial we'll explore some of the "
"basics of turtle drawing."
msgstr "新使用者應該從這裡開始。在本教學中，我們將探索海龜繪圖的一些基礎知識。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:79
msgid "Starting a turtle environment"
msgstr "啟動海龜環境"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:81
msgid "In a Python shell, import all the objects of the ``turtle`` module::"
msgstr "在 Python shell 中，引入 ``turtle`` 模組中所有物件： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:83
msgid "from turtle import *"
msgstr "from turtle import *"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:85
msgid ""
"If you run into a ``Standard library module '_tkinter' was not found`` "
"error, you'll have to install the :mod:`Tk interface package <tkinter>` on "
"your system."
msgstr ""
"如果你遇到 ``Standard library module '_tkinter' was not found`` 錯誤，你需要"
"在系統上安裝 :mod:`Tk 介面套件 <tkinter>`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:88
msgid ""
"Nothing appears yet. To open the turtle window, make the turtle visible::"
msgstr "目前還什麼都看不到。要開啟海龜視窗，請讓海龜顯示出來： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:90
msgid "showturtle()"
msgstr "showturtle()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:92
msgid ""
"A new window opens, with the turtle in the middle, shown as an arrow heading "
"East."
msgstr "一個新的視窗會開啟，海龜位於中央，以一個朝向東方的箭頭表示。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:97
msgid "Basic drawing"
msgstr "基本繪圖"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:99
msgid "Send the turtle forward 100 steps::"
msgstr "讓海龜向前移動 100 步： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:101
msgid "forward(100)"
msgstr "forward(100)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:103
msgid ""
"You should see a line drawn by the turtle, heading East. Change the "
"direction of the turtle, so that it turns 120 degrees left (anti-clockwise)::"
msgstr ""
"你應該會看到海龜畫出一條朝向東方的線。改變海龜的方向，讓它向左轉 120 度（逆時"
"針）： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:107
msgid "left(120)"
msgstr "left(120)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:109
msgid "Let's continue by drawing a triangle::"
msgstr "接著來畫一個三角形： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:111
msgid ""
"forward(100)\n"
"left(120)\n"
"forward(100)"
msgstr ""
"forward(100)\n"
"left(120)\n"
"forward(100)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:115
msgid ""
"Notice how the turtle, represented by an arrow, points in different "
"directions as you steer it."
msgstr "注意以箭頭表示的海龜，會隨著你的操控指向不同的方向。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:118
msgid ""
"Experiment with those commands, and also with ``backward()`` and "
"``right()``. Many commands also have shorter aliases, such as ``fd()`` "
"for :func:`forward`."
msgstr ""
"試試看這些指令，也試試 ``backward()`` 和 ``right()``。許多指令也有較短的別"
"名，例如 :func:`forward` 的別名 ``fd()``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:124 ../../library/turtle.rst:812
msgid "Pen control"
msgstr "畫筆控制"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:126
msgid ""
"Try changing the color - for example, ``color('blue')`` - and width of the "
"line - for example, ``width(3)`` - and then drawing again."
msgstr ""
"試著改變顏色（例如 ``color('blue')``）以及線條的寬度（例如 ``width(3)``），然"
"後再畫一次。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:129
msgid ""
"You can also move the turtle around without drawing, by lifting up the pen: "
"``up()`` before moving. To start drawing again, use ``down()``."
msgstr ""
"你也可以提起畫筆，讓海龜移動時不畫線：在移動之前呼叫 ``up()``。要重新開始畫"
"線，請使用 ``down()``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:134
msgid "The turtle's position"
msgstr "海龜的位置"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:136
msgid ""
"Send your turtle back to its starting-point (useful if it has disappeared "
"off-screen)::"
msgstr "讓你的海龜回到起點（如果它跑出螢幕外不見了，這會很有用）： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:139
msgid "home()"
msgstr "home()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:141
msgid ""
"The home position is at the center of the turtle's screen. If you ever need "
"to know them, get the turtle's x-y coordinates with::"
msgstr ""
"起始位置 (home position) 在海龜螢幕的中央。如果你需要知道海龜的 x-y 座標，可"
"以這樣取得： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:144
msgid "pos()"
msgstr "pos()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:146
msgid "Home is at ``(0, 0)``."
msgstr "起始位置是 ``(0, 0)``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:148
msgid ""
"And after a while, it will probably help to clear the window so we can start "
"anew::"
msgstr "畫了一陣子之後，可能會想把視窗清空，好重新開始： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:151
msgid "clearscreen()"
msgstr "clearscreen()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:155
msgid "Making algorithmic patterns"
msgstr "用演算法畫出圖案"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:157
msgid "Using loops, it's possible to build up geometric patterns::"
msgstr "使用迴圈就能建構出幾何圖案： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:159
msgid ""
"for steps in range(100):\n"
"    for c in ('blue', 'red', 'green'):\n"
"        color(c)\n"
"        forward(steps)\n"
"        right(30)"
msgstr ""
"for steps in range(100):\n"
"    for c in ('blue', 'red', 'green'):\n"
"        color(c)\n"
"        forward(steps)\n"
"        right(30)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:166
msgid "\\ - which of course, are limited only by the imagination!"
msgstr "\\ 當然，能畫出哪些圖案，只受限於你的想像力！"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:168
msgid ""
"Let's draw the star shape at the top of this page. We want red lines, filled "
"in with yellow::"
msgstr "我們來畫出本頁頂端的星形。我們想要紅色的線條，並以黃色填色： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:171
msgid ""
"color('red')\n"
"fillcolor('yellow')"
msgstr ""
"color('red')\n"
"fillcolor('yellow')"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:174
msgid ""
"Just as ``up()`` and ``down()`` determine whether lines will be drawn, "
"filling can be turned on and off::"
msgstr "就像 ``up()`` 和 ``down()`` 決定是否要畫線，填色也可以開啟和關閉： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:177
msgid "begin_fill()"
msgstr "begin_fill()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:179
msgid "Next we'll create a loop::"
msgstr "接下來我們會建立一個迴圈： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:181
msgid ""
"start = pos()\n"
"\n"
"while True:\n"
"    forward(200)\n"
"    left(170)\n"
"    if distance(start) < 1:\n"
"        break"
msgstr ""
"start = pos()\n"
"\n"
"while True:\n"
"    forward(200)\n"
"    left(170)\n"
"    if distance(start) < 1:\n"
"        break"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:189
msgid ""
"``distance(start) < 1`` is a good way to know when the turtle is back at its "
"start position."
msgstr "``distance(start) < 1`` 是判斷海龜何時回到起始位置的好方法。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:192
msgid "Finally, complete the filling::"
msgstr "最後，完成填色： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:194
msgid "end_fill()"
msgstr "end_fill()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:196
msgid ""
"(Note that filling only actually takes place when you give the "
"``end_fill()`` command.)"
msgstr "（請注意，只有在你下達 ``end_fill()`` 指令時，才會真正進行填色。）"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:204
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "參考"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:210
msgid "Turtle methods and functions"
msgstr "Turtle 的方法與函式"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:212
msgid ""
"Most of the examples in this section refer to a Turtle instance called "
"``turtle``."
msgstr "本節的大多數範例都是針對一個名為 ``turtle`` 的 Turtle 實例。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:218
msgid "Move and draw"
msgstr "移動與繪圖"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "參數"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:223 ../../library/turtle.rst:245
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:269 ../../library/turtle.rst:295
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:395 ../../library/turtle.rst:417
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:440 ../../library/turtle.rst:491
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:765 ../../library/turtle.rst:1314
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1738 ../../library/turtle.rst:1739
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1740 ../../library/turtle.rst:1741
msgid "a number"
msgstr "一個數字"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:225
msgid ""
"Move the turtle forward by the specified *distance*, in the direction the "
"turtle is headed."
msgstr "讓海龜朝著它目前朝向的方向，向前移動指定的距離 *distance*。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:228
msgid ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(25)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(25.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(-75)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-50.00,0.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(25)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(25.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(-75)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-50.00,0.00)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:247
msgid ""
"Move the turtle backward by *distance*, opposite to the direction the turtle "
"is headed. The turtle's heading does not change."
msgstr ""
"讓海龜朝著與它朝向相反的方向，向後移動 *distance*。海龜的朝向不會改變。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:256
msgid ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.backward(30)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-30.00,0.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.backward(30)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-30.00,0.00)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:271
msgid ""
"Turn the turtle right by the specified *angle*. The angle is measured in "
"degrees by default; the unit can be changed with :func:`degrees` "
"or :func:`radians`. How the heading is measured depends on the turtle mode, "
"see :func:`mode`."
msgstr ""
"讓海龜向右轉指定的角度 *angle*。角度預設以度為單位；單位可以"
"用 :func:`degrees` 或 :func:`radians` 更改。朝向的量測方式取決於海龜模式，請"
"參閱 :func:`mode`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:282
msgid ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"22.0\n"
">>> turtle.right(45)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"337.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"22.0\n"
">>> turtle.right(45)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"337.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:297
msgid ""
"Turn the turtle left by the specified *angle*. The angle is measured in "
"degrees by default; the unit can be changed with :func:`degrees` "
"or :func:`radians`. How the heading is measured depends on the turtle mode, "
"see :func:`mode`."
msgstr ""
"讓海龜向左轉指定的角度 *angle*。角度預設以度為單位；單位可以"
"用 :func:`degrees` 或 :func:`radians` 更改。朝向的量測方式取決於海龜模式，請"
"參閱 :func:`mode`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:308
msgid ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"22.0\n"
">>> turtle.left(45)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"67.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"22.0\n"
">>> turtle.left(45)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"67.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:322
msgid "a number or a pair/vector of numbers"
msgstr "一個數字，或一對數字／一個數字向量"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:323 ../../library/turtle.rst:355
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:356 ../../library/turtle.rst:492
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1292 ../../library/turtle.rst:1334
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1357 ../../library/turtle.rst:1358
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1359 ../../library/turtle.rst:1360
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1979 ../../library/turtle.rst:1980
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1981 ../../library/turtle.rst:2027
msgid "a number or ``None``"
msgstr "一個數字或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:325
msgid ""
"Move the turtle to an absolute position. If *y* is ``None``, *x* must be a "
"pair of coordinates or a :class:`Vec2D`, for example as returned "
"by :func:`pos`. If the pen is down, a line is drawn. The turtle's heading "
"does not change."
msgstr ""
"將海龜移動到一個絕對位置。如果 *y* 為 ``None``，*x* 必須是一對座標或一"
"個 :class:`Vec2D`，例如 :func:`pos` 所回傳的值。如果畫筆是放下的，就會畫出一"
"條線。海龜的朝向不會改變。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:336
msgid ""
">>> tp = turtle.pos()\n"
">>> tp\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto(60,30)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,30.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto((20,80))\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(20.00,80.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto(tp)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> tp = turtle.pos()\n"
">>> tp\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto(60,30)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,30.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto((20,80))\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(20.00,80.00)\n"
">>> turtle.goto(tp)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:357 ../../library/turtle.rst:1156
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2142
msgid "a boolean"
msgstr "一個布林值"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:359
msgid ""
"Teleport, or instantly move, the turtle to an absolute position. "
"Unlike :func:`goto`, no line is drawn. If *x* or *y* is not given, that "
"coordinate is kept as it is. The turtle's heading does not change."
msgstr ""
"將海龜傳送（也就是瞬間移動）到一個絕對位置。與 :func:`goto` 不同，這不會畫出"
"線條。如果沒有給定 *x* 或 *y*，該座標會保持不變。海龜的朝向不會改變。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:363
msgid ""
"If the turtle is filling a shape, the shape drawn so far is finished and "
"filled before teleporting, and filling starts again at the new position. "
"Pass ``fill_gap=True`` to keep filling one shape instead. The teleport then "
"counts as an edge of the shape, as it would with :func:`goto`."
msgstr ""
"如果海龜正在為一個形狀填色，那麼到目前為止畫出的形狀會在傳送前完成並填色，接"
"著在新位置重新開始填色。若要繼續為同一個形狀填色，請傳入 ``fill_gap=True``。"
"此時這次傳送會被視為該形狀的一條邊，就像使用 :func:`goto` 時一樣。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:374
msgid ""
">>> tp = turtle.pos()\n"
">>> tp\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(60)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(y=10)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,10.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(20, 30)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(20.00,30.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> tp = turtle.pos()\n"
">>> tp\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(60)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(y=10)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(60.00,10.00)\n"
">>> turtle.teleport(20, 30)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(20.00,30.00)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:397
msgid "Set the turtle's x coordinate to *x*. The y coordinate is unchanged."
msgstr "將海龜的 x 座標設為 *x*。y 座標不變。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:405
msgid ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,240.00)\n"
">>> turtle.setx(10)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(10.00,240.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,240.00)\n"
">>> turtle.setx(10)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(10.00,240.00)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:419
msgid "Set the turtle's y coordinate to *y*. The x coordinate is unchanged."
msgstr "將海龜的 y 座標設為 *y*。x 座標不變。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:427
msgid ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,40.00)\n"
">>> turtle.sety(-10)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-10.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,40.00)\n"
">>> turtle.sety(-10)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-10.00)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:442
msgid ""
"Set the turtle's heading to *to_angle*. Here are some common directions in "
"degrees:"
msgstr "將海龜的朝向設為 *to_angle*。以下是一些以度表示的常見方向："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:446
msgid "standard mode"
msgstr "標準模式"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:446
msgid "logo mode"
msgstr "logo 模式"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:448
msgid "0 - east"
msgstr "0 - 東"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:448
msgid "0 - north"
msgstr "0 - 北"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:449
msgid "90 - north"
msgstr "90 - 北"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:449
msgid "90 - east"
msgstr "90 - 東"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:450
msgid "180 - west"
msgstr "180 - 西"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:450
msgid "180 - south"
msgstr "180 - 南"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:451
msgid "270 - south"
msgstr "270 - 南"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:451
msgid "270 - west"
msgstr "270 - 西"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:454
msgid ""
">>> turtle.setheading(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.setheading(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:464
msgid ""
"Move the turtle to the origin, coordinates (0,0). The turtle's heading is "
"set to its start orientation, which depends on the turtle mode, "
"see :func:`mode`."
msgstr ""
"將海龜移動到原點，也就是座標 (0,0)。海龜的朝向會被設為它的起始朝向，起始朝向"
"取決於海龜模式，請參閱 :func:`mode`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:475
msgid ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-10.00)\n"
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-10.00)\n"
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:493 ../../library/turtle.rst:590
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1581 ../../library/turtle.rst:2182
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2183
msgid "an integer or ``None``"
msgstr "一個整數或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:495
msgid ""
"Draw a circle with the given *radius*. The center is *radius* units left of "
"the turtle; *extent*, an angle, determines which part of the circle is "
"drawn. If *extent* is not given, draw the entire circle. If *extent* is not "
"a full circle, one endpoint of the arc is the current pen position. Draw the "
"arc in the counterclockwise direction if *radius* is positive, otherwise in "
"the clockwise direction. Finally, the turtle's heading is changed by "
"*extent*."
msgstr ""
"以給定的半徑 *radius* 畫一個圓。圓心位於海龜左側 *radius* 個單位處；*extent* "
"是一個角度，決定要畫出圓的哪個部分。如果沒有給定 *extent*，就畫出整個圓。如"
"果 *extent* 不是一整圈，弧的其中一個端點就是目前的畫筆位置。如果 *radius* 為"
"正，就以逆時針方向畫弧，否則以順時針方向畫弧。最後，海龜的朝向會改變 "
"*extent* 的角度。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:503
msgid ""
"As the circle is approximated by an inscribed regular polygon, *steps* "
"determines the number of steps to use. If not given, it will be calculated "
"automatically. May be used to draw regular polygons."
msgstr ""
"由於圓是以內接正多邊形來近似，*steps* 決定要使用的步數。如果沒有給定，會自動"
"計算。也可以用來畫正多邊形。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:507
msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0\n"
">>> turtle.circle(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0\n"
">>> turtle.circle(120, 180)  # draw a semicircle\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,240.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"180.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0\n"
">>> turtle.circle(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(-0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0\n"
">>> turtle.circle(120, 180)  # 畫一個半圓\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,240.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"180.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:533 ../../library/turtle.rst:1712
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1713
msgid "a positive integer or ``None``"
msgstr "一個正整數或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:534
msgid "a colorstring or a numeric color tuple"
msgstr "一個顏色字串或一個數值顏色元組"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:536
msgid ""
"Draw a circular dot with diameter *size*, using *color*. If *size* is not "
"given, the larger of ``pensize + 4`` and ``2 * pensize`` is used. If *color* "
"is not given, the current pencolor is used."
msgstr ""
"以顏色 *color* 畫一個直徑為 *size* 的圓點。如果沒有給定 *size*，會使用 "
"``pensize + 4`` 和 ``2 * pensize`` 中較大的那個。如果沒有給定 *color*，會使用"
"目前的畫筆顏色。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:540
msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.dot()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50); turtle.dot(20, \"blue\"); turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(100.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.dot()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50); turtle.dot(20, \"blue\"); turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(100.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:554
msgid ""
"Stamp a copy of the turtle shape onto the canvas and return its id. The "
"stamp is placed at the current turtle position. The returned id can be used "
"to delete the stamp with :func:`clearstamp`."
msgstr ""
"在畫布上蓋印一個海龜形狀的副本，並回傳它的 id。印記會放在目前的海龜位置。回傳"
"的 id 可用來以 :func:`clearstamp` 刪除該印記。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:558
msgid ""
">>> turtle.color(\"blue\")\n"
">>> stamp_id = turtle.stamp()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.color(\"blue\")\n"
">>> stamp_id = turtle.stamp()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:568 ../../library/turtle.rst:1403
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1426 ../../library/turtle.rst:1454
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1906
msgid "an integer"
msgstr "一個整數"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:570
msgid ""
"Delete the stamp with the given *stampid*. *stampid* must be the return "
"value of a previous :func:`stamp` call."
msgstr ""
"刪除給定 *stampid* 的印記。*stampid* 必須是先前呼叫 :func:`stamp` 的回傳值。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:573
msgid ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(150.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.color(\"blue\")\n"
">>> astamp = turtle.stamp()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(200.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamp(astamp)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(200.00,-0.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(150.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.color(\"blue\")\n"
">>> astamp = turtle.stamp()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(200.00,-0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamp(astamp)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(200.00,-0.00)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:592
msgid ""
"Delete all or the first or last *n* of the turtle's stamps. If *n* is not "
"given, delete all stamps. If *n* is positive, delete the first *n* stamps. "
"If *n* is negative, delete the last *n* stamps, so -2 deletes the last two."
msgstr ""
"刪除海龜的全部印記，或前 *n* 個、最後 *n* 個印記。如果沒有給定 *n*，就刪除所"
"有印記。如果 *n* 為正，刪除前 *n* 個印記。如果 *n* 為負，刪除最後 *n* 個印"
"記，因此 -2 會刪除最後兩個。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:596
msgid ""
">>> for i in range(8):\n"
"...     unused_stamp_id = turtle.stamp()\n"
"...     turtle.fd(30)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps(2)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps(-2)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps()"
msgstr ""
">>> for i in range(8):\n"
"...     unused_stamp_id = turtle.stamp()\n"
"...     turtle.fd(30)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps(2)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps(-2)\n"
">>> turtle.clearstamps()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:609
msgid ""
"Undo the last turtle action. Calling :func:`!undo` repeatedly undoes one "
"action at a time. The number of actions that can be undone is set by the "
"size of the undo buffer, see :func:`setundobuffer`."
msgstr ""
"復原上一個海龜動作。重複呼叫 :func:`!undo` 會一次復原一個動作。可以復原的動作"
"數量由復原緩衝區的大小決定，請參閱 :func:`setundobuffer`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:613
msgid ""
">>> for i in range(4):\n"
"...     turtle.fd(50); turtle.lt(80)\n"
"...\n"
">>> for i in range(8):\n"
"...     turtle.undo()"
msgstr ""
">>> for i in range(4):\n"
"...     turtle.fd(50); turtle.lt(80)\n"
"...\n"
">>> for i in range(8):\n"
"...     turtle.undo()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:625
msgid "an integer, a string or ``None``"
msgstr "一個整數、一個字串或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:627
msgid ""
"Return or set the turtle's speed. If *speed* is not given, return the "
"current speed. Otherwise set the turtle's speed to an integer from 0 to 10. "
"A number above 0.5 and below 10.5 is rounded to the nearest integer. Any "
"other number sets the speed to 0. You can also use these names instead of "
"numbers:"
msgstr ""
"回傳或設定海龜的速度。如果沒有給定 *speed*，就回傳目前的速度。否則將海龜的速"
"度設為 0 到 10 之間的整數。大於 0.5 且小於 10.5 的數字會被捨入為最接近的整"
"數。其他任何數字都會將速度設為 0。你也可以用以下名稱代替數字："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:633
msgid "\"fastest\": 0"
msgstr "\"fastest\": 0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:634
msgid "\"fast\": 10"
msgstr "\"fast\": 10"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:635
msgid "\"normal\": 6"
msgstr "\"normal\": 6"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:636
msgid "\"slow\": 3"
msgstr "\"slow\": 3"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:637
msgid "\"slowest\": 1"
msgstr "\"slowest\": 1"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:639
msgid ""
"Speeds from 1 to 10 give increasingly faster animation of line drawing and "
"turtle turning. A speed of 0 means that no animation takes "
"place: :func:`forward` and :func:`back` make the turtle jump, and "
"likewise :func:`left` and :func:`right` make the turtle turn instantly."
msgstr ""
"速度 1 到 10 會讓畫線與海龜轉向的動畫越來越快。速度 0 表示沒有動"
"畫：:func:`forward` 和 :func:`back` 會讓海龜直接跳過去，同樣地，:func:`left` "
"和 :func:`right` 會讓海龜瞬間轉向。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:644
msgid ""
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"3\n"
">>> turtle.speed('normal')\n"
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"6\n"
">>> turtle.speed(9)\n"
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"9"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"3\n"
">>> turtle.speed('normal')\n"
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"6\n"
">>> turtle.speed(9)\n"
">>> turtle.speed()\n"
"9"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:658
msgid "Tell Turtle's state"
msgstr "查詢海龜的狀態"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:663
msgid "Return the turtle's current location (x,y) as a :class:`Vec2D` vector."
msgstr "以 :class:`Vec2D` 向量回傳海龜目前的位置 (x,y)。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:665
msgid ""
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(440.00,-0.00)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(440.00,-0.00)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:674 ../../library/turtle.rst:739
msgid "a number or a pair/vector of numbers or a turtle instance"
msgstr "一個數字、一對數字／一個數字向量，或一個海龜實例"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:675 ../../library/turtle.rst:740
msgid "a number if *x* is a number, else ``None``"
msgstr "如果 *x* 是數字則為一個數字，否則為 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:677
msgid ""
"Return the angle of the line from the turtle's position to (x,y). If *y* is "
"``None``, *x* must be a pair of coordinates, a :class:`Vec2D`, for example "
"as returned by :func:`pos`, or another turtle. The angle is measured from "
"the turtle's start orientation, which depends on the turtle mode, "
"see :func:`mode`."
msgstr ""
"回傳從海龜位置到 (x,y) 的連線角度。如果 *y* 為 ``None``，*x* 必須是一對座標、"
"一個 :class:`Vec2D`\\ （例如 :func:`pos` 所回傳的值），或另一隻海龜。角度是從"
"海龜的起始朝向開始量測，起始朝向取決於海龜模式，請參閱 :func:`mode`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:683
msgid ""
">>> turtle.goto(10, 10)\n"
">>> turtle.towards(0,0)\n"
"225.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.goto(10, 10)\n"
">>> turtle.towards(0,0)\n"
"225.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:693
msgid "Return the turtle's x coordinate."
msgstr "回傳海龜的 x 座標。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:695
msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(50)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(64.28,76.60)\n"
">>> print(round(turtle.xcor(), 5))\n"
"64.27876"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(50)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> turtle.pos()\n"
"(64.28,76.60)\n"
">>> print(round(turtle.xcor(), 5))\n"
"64.27876"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:709
msgid "Return the turtle's y coordinate."
msgstr "回傳海龜的 y 座標。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:711
msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(60)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> print(turtle.pos())\n"
"(50.00,86.60)\n"
">>> print(round(turtle.ycor(), 5))\n"
"86.60254"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(60)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> print(turtle.pos())\n"
"(50.00,86.60)\n"
">>> print(round(turtle.ycor(), 5))\n"
"86.60254"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:725
msgid ""
"Return the turtle's current heading. The value depends on the turtle mode, "
"see :func:`mode`."
msgstr "回傳海龜目前的朝向。此值取決於海龜模式，請參閱 :func:`mode`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:728
msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(67)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"67.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(67)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"67.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:742
msgid ""
"Return the distance from the turtle to (x,y) in turtle step units. If *y* is "
"``None``, *x* must be a pair of coordinates, a :class:`Vec2D`, for example "
"as returned by :func:`pos`, or another turtle."
msgstr ""
"回傳海龜到 (x,y) 的距離，以海龜的步長為單位。如果 *y* 為 ``None``，*x* 必須是"
"一對座標、一個 :class:`Vec2D`\\ （例如 :func:`pos` 所回傳的值），或另一隻海"
"龜。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:746
msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.distance(30,40)\n"
"50.0\n"
">>> turtle.distance((30,40))\n"
"50.0\n"
">>> joe = Turtle()\n"
">>> joe.forward(77)\n"
">>> turtle.distance(joe)\n"
"77.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.distance(30,40)\n"
"50.0\n"
">>> turtle.distance((30,40))\n"
"50.0\n"
">>> joe = Turtle()\n"
">>> joe.forward(77)\n"
">>> turtle.distance(joe)\n"
"77.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:761
msgid "Settings for measurement"
msgstr "量測設定"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:767
msgid ""
"Set the angle measurement units to degrees. The number of degrees in a full "
"circle is set to *fullcircle*, which defaults to 360."
msgstr "將角度量測單位設為度。一整圈的度數設為 *fullcircle*，預設為 360。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:770
msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
"\n"
">>> # Change angle measurement unit to grad (also known as gon,\n"
">>> # grade, or gradian and equals 1/100-th of the right angle.)\n"
">>> turtle.degrees(400.0)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"100.0\n"
">>> turtle.degrees(360)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
"\n"
">>> # 將角度量測單位改為百分度（grad，也稱為 gon、\n"
">>> # grade 或 gradian，等於直角的 1/100）\n"
">>> turtle.degrees(400.0)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"100.0\n"
">>> turtle.degrees(360)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:790
msgid ""
"Set the angle measurement units to radians.  Equivalent to ``degrees(2 * "
"math.pi)``."
msgstr "將角度量測單位設為弧度。等同於 ``degrees(2 * math.pi)``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:793
msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
">>> turtle.radians()\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"1.5707963267948966"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.left(90)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"90.0\n"
">>> turtle.radians()\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"1.5707963267948966"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:815
msgid "Drawing state"
msgstr "繪圖狀態"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:821
msgid "Lower the pen. The turtle draws a line when it moves."
msgstr "放下畫筆。海龜移動時會畫出線條。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:828
msgid "Lift the pen. The turtle does not draw when it moves."
msgstr "提起畫筆。海龜移動時不會畫線。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:834 ../../library/turtle.rst:1258
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1259 ../../library/turtle.rst:1260
msgid "a positive number or ``None``"
msgstr "一個正數或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:836
msgid ""
"Return or set the line thickness. If *width* is not given, return the "
"current pensize. If resizemode is set to \"auto\" and the turtle shape is a "
"polygon, that polygon is drawn with the same line thickness."
msgstr ""
"回傳或設定線條粗細。如果沒有給定 *width*，就回傳目前的畫筆粗細。如果 "
"resizemode 設為 \"auto\" 且海龜形狀是多邊形，該多邊形也會以相同的線條粗細繪"
"製。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:840
msgid ""
">>> turtle.pensize()\n"
"1\n"
">>> turtle.pensize(10)   # from here on lines of width 10 are drawn"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.pensize()\n"
"1\n"
">>> turtle.pensize(10)   # 從這裡開始，畫出的線條寬度為 10"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:850
msgid "a dictionary or ``None``"
msgstr "一個字典或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:851
msgid "keyword arguments with the keys below"
msgstr "使用以下各鍵的關鍵字引數"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:853
msgid ""
"Return or set the pen's attributes. The attributes are returned as a "
"dictionary with the following keys and values:"
msgstr "回傳或設定畫筆的屬性。屬性會以字典回傳，包含以下的鍵和值："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:856
msgid "\"shown\": ``True`` or ``False``"
msgstr "\"shown\": ``True`` 或 ``False``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:857
msgid "\"pendown\": ``True`` or ``False``"
msgstr "\"pendown\": ``True`` 或 ``False``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:858
msgid "\"pencolor\": a color string or a color tuple"
msgstr "\"pencolor\": 一個顏色字串或一個顏色元組"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:859
msgid "\"fillcolor\": a color string or a color tuple"
msgstr "\"fillcolor\": 一個顏色字串或一個顏色元組"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:860
msgid "\"pensize\": a positive number"
msgstr "\"pensize\": 一個正數"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:861
msgid "\"speed\": a number from 0 to 10"
msgstr "\"speed\": 一個 0 到 10 之間的數字"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:862
msgid "\"resizemode\": \"auto\", \"user\" or \"noresize\""
msgstr "\"resizemode\": \"auto\"、\"user\" 或 \"noresize\""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:863
msgid "\"stretchfactor\": a pair of positive numbers"
msgstr "\"stretchfactor\": 一對正數"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:864
msgid "\"shearfactor\": a number"
msgstr "\"shearfactor\": 一個數字"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:865
msgid "\"outline\": a positive number"
msgstr "\"outline\": 一個正數"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:866
msgid "\"tilt\": a number"
msgstr "\"tilt\": 一個數字"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:868
msgid ""
"Such a dictionary can be passed as *pen* to restore a former pen state. The "
"attributes can also be given as keyword arguments, which can be used to set "
"several of them in one statement."
msgstr ""
"這樣的字典可以作為 *pen* 傳入，以還原先前的畫筆狀態。這些屬性也可以用關鍵字引"
"數給定，以便在一個陳述式中設定其中的多個屬性。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:872
msgid ""
">>> turtle.pen(fillcolor=\"black\", pencolor=\"red\", pensize=10)\n"
">>> turtle.pen()\n"
"{'shown': True, 'pendown': True, 'pencolor': 'red', 'fillcolor': 'black',\n"
" 'pensize': 10, 'speed': 9, 'resizemode': 'noresize',\n"
" 'stretchfactor': (1.0, 1.0), 'shearfactor': 0.0, 'outline': 1,\n"
" 'tilt': 0.0}\n"
">>> penstate = turtle.pen()\n"
">>> turtle.color(\"yellow\", \"\")\n"
">>> turtle.penup()\n"
">>> turtle.pen()[\"pencolor\"]\n"
"'yellow'\n"
">>> # restore the saved pen state, but with a green fill\n"
">>> turtle.pen(penstate, fillcolor=\"green\")\n"
">>> turtle.pen()[\"pencolor\"]\n"
"'red'\n"
">>> turtle.pen()[\"fillcolor\"]\n"
"'green'"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.pen(fillcolor=\"black\", pencolor=\"red\", pensize=10)\n"
">>> turtle.pen()\n"
"{'shown': True, 'pendown': True, 'pencolor': 'red', 'fillcolor': 'black',\n"
" 'pensize': 10, 'speed': 9, 'resizemode': 'noresize',\n"
" 'stretchfactor': (1.0, 1.0), 'shearfactor': 0.0, 'outline': 1,\n"
" 'tilt': 0.0}\n"
">>> penstate = turtle.pen()\n"
">>> turtle.color(\"yellow\", \"\")\n"
">>> turtle.penup()\n"
">>> turtle.pen()[\"pencolor\"]\n"
"'yellow'\n"
">>> # 還原儲存的畫筆狀態，但填充顏色改為綠色\n"
">>> turtle.pen(penstate, fillcolor=\"green\")\n"
">>> turtle.pen()[\"pencolor\"]\n"
"'red'\n"
">>> turtle.pen()[\"fillcolor\"]\n"
"'green'"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:896
msgid "Return ``True`` if the pen is down, ``False`` if it's up."
msgstr "如果畫筆是放下的就回傳 ``True``，如果是提起的則回傳 ``False``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:898
msgid ""
">>> turtle.penup()\n"
">>> turtle.isdown()\n"
"False\n"
">>> turtle.pendown()\n"
">>> turtle.isdown()\n"
"True"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.penup()\n"
">>> turtle.isdown()\n"
"False\n"
">>> turtle.pendown()\n"
">>> turtle.isdown()\n"
"True"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:910
msgid "Color control"
msgstr "顏色控制"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:916
msgid "Return or set the pencolor."
msgstr "回傳或設定畫筆顏色。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:918 ../../library/turtle.rst:970
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1630
msgid "Four input formats are allowed:"
msgstr "允許四種輸入格式："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:920
msgid "``pencolor()``"
msgstr "``pencolor()``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:921
msgid ""
"Return the current pencolor as color specification string or as a tuple (see "
"example).  May be used as input to "
"another :func:`color`, :func:`pencolor`, :func:`fillcolor` "
"or :func:`bgcolor` call."
msgstr ""
"以顏色規格字串或元組的形式回傳目前的畫筆顏色（請參閱範例）。可作為另一"
"個 :func:`color`、:func:`pencolor`、:func:`fillcolor` 或 :func:`bgcolor` 呼叫"
"的輸入。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:926
msgid "``pencolor(colorstring)``"
msgstr "``pencolor(colorstring)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:927
msgid ""
"Set the pencolor to *colorstring*, which is a Tk color specification string, "
"such as ``\"red\"``, ``\"yellow\"``, or ``\"#33cc8c\"``."
msgstr ""
"將畫筆顏色設為 *colorstring*，它是一個 Tk 顏色規格字串，例如 ``\"red\"``、"
"``\"yellow\"`` 或 ``\"#33cc8c\"``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:930
msgid "``pencolor((r, g, b))``"
msgstr "``pencolor((r, g, b))``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:931
msgid ""
"Set the pencolor to the RGB color represented by the tuple of *r*, *g*, and "
"*b*. Each of *r*, *g*, and *b* must be between 0 and colormode, where "
"colormode is either 1.0 or 255 (see :func:`colormode`)."
msgstr ""
"將畫筆顏色設為由 *r*、*g* 和 *b* 組成的元組所表示的 RGB 顏色。*r*、*g* 和 "
"*b* 都必須介於 0 和 colormode 之間，其中 colormode 是 1.0 或 255（請參"
"閱 :func:`colormode`）。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:935
msgid "``pencolor(r, g, b)``"
msgstr "``pencolor(r, g, b)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:936
msgid ""
"Set the pencolor to the RGB color represented by *r*, *g*, and *b*. Each of "
"*r*, *g*, and *b* must be between 0 and colormode."
msgstr ""
"將畫筆顏色設為由 *r*、*g* 和 *b* 所表示的 RGB 顏色。*r*、*g* 和 *b* 都必須介"
"於 0 和 colormode 之間。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:939
msgid ""
"If the turtle shape is a polygon, the outline of that polygon is drawn with "
"the newly set pencolor."
msgstr "如果海龜形狀是多邊形，該多邊形的輪廓會以新設定的畫筆顏色繪製。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:942
msgid ""
">>> colormode()\n"
"1.0\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"'red'\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(\"brown\")\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"'brown'\n"
">>> tup = (0.2, 0.8, 0.55)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(tup)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(0.2, 0.8, 0.5490196078431373)\n"
">>> colormode(255)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(51.0, 204.0, 140.0)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor('#32c18f')\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)"
msgstr ""
">>> colormode()\n"
"1.0\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"'red'\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(\"brown\")\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"'brown'\n"
">>> tup = (0.2, 0.8, 0.55)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(tup)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(0.2, 0.8, 0.5490196078431373)\n"
">>> colormode(255)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(51.0, 204.0, 140.0)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor('#32c18f')\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:968
msgid "Return or set the fillcolor."
msgstr "回傳或設定填充顏色。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:972
msgid "``fillcolor()``"
msgstr "``fillcolor()``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:973
msgid ""
"Return the current fillcolor as color specification string, possibly in "
"tuple format (see example).  May be used as input to "
"another :func:`color`, :func:`pencolor`, :func:`fillcolor` "
"or :func:`bgcolor` call."
msgstr ""
"以顏色規格字串的形式回傳目前的填充顏色，也可能是元組格式（請參閱範例）。可作"
"為另一個 :func:`color`、:func:`pencolor`、:func:`fillcolor` "
"或 :func:`bgcolor` 呼叫的輸入。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:978
msgid "``fillcolor(colorstring)``"
msgstr "``fillcolor(colorstring)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:979
msgid ""
"Set the fillcolor to *colorstring*, which is a Tk color specification "
"string, such as ``\"red\"``, ``\"yellow\"``, or ``\"#33cc8c\"``."
msgstr ""
"將填充顏色設為 *colorstring*，它是一個 Tk 顏色規格字串，例如 ``\"red\"``、"
"``\"yellow\"`` 或 ``\"#33cc8c\"``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:982
msgid "``fillcolor((r, g, b))``"
msgstr "``fillcolor((r, g, b))``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:983
msgid ""
"Set the fillcolor to the RGB color represented by the tuple of *r*, *g*, and "
"*b*. Each of *r*, *g*, and *b* must be between 0 and colormode, where "
"colormode is either 1.0 or 255 (see :func:`colormode`)."
msgstr ""
"將填充顏色設為由 *r*、*g* 和 *b* 組成的元組所表示的 RGB 顏色。*r*、*g* 和 "
"*b* 都必須介於 0 和 colormode 之間，其中 colormode 是 1.0 或 255（請參"
"閱 :func:`colormode`）。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:987
msgid "``fillcolor(r, g, b)``"
msgstr "``fillcolor(r, g, b)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:988
msgid ""
"Set the fillcolor to the RGB color represented by *r*, *g*, and *b*. Each of "
"*r*, *g*, and *b* must be between 0 and colormode."
msgstr ""
"將填充顏色設為由 *r*、*g* 和 *b* 所表示的 RGB 顏色。*r*、*g* 和 *b* 都必須介"
"於 0 和 colormode 之間。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:991
msgid ""
"If the turtle shape is a polygon, the interior of that polygon is drawn with "
"the newly set fillcolor."
msgstr "如果海龜形狀是多邊形，該多邊形的內部會以新設定的填充顏色繪製。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:994
msgid ""
">>> turtle.fillcolor(\"violet\")\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"'violet'\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor((50, 193, 143))  # Integers, not floats\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor('#ffffff')\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"(255.0, 255.0, 255.0)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.fillcolor(\"violet\")\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"'violet'\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor((50, 193, 143))  # 為整數而非浮點數\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"(50.0, 193.0, 143.0)\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor('#ffffff')\n"
">>> turtle.fillcolor()\n"
"(255.0, 255.0, 255.0)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1015
msgid "Return or set the pencolor and fillcolor."
msgstr "回傳或設定畫筆顏色和填充顏色。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1017
msgid ""
"Several input formats are allowed. They use 0 to 3 arguments as follows:"
msgstr "允許數種輸入格式。它們使用 0 到 3 個引數，如下所示："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1020
msgid "``color()``"
msgstr "``color()``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1021
msgid ""
"Return the current pencolor and the current fillcolor as a pair of color "
"specification strings or tuples as returned by :func:`pencolor` "
"and :func:`fillcolor`."
msgstr ""
"以一對顏色規格字串或元組的形式，回傳目前的畫筆顏色和目前的填充顏色，格式"
"與 :func:`pencolor` 和 :func:`fillcolor` 的回傳值相同。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1025
msgid "``color(colorstring)``, ``color((r,g,b))``, ``color(r,g,b)``"
msgstr "``color(colorstring)``, ``color((r,g,b))``, ``color(r,g,b)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1026
msgid ""
"Inputs as in :func:`pencolor`. Set both the pencolor and the fillcolor to "
"the given value."
msgstr "輸入方式與 :func:`pencolor` 相同。將畫筆顏色和填充顏色都設為給定的值。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1029
msgid ""
"``color(colorstring1, colorstring2)``, ``color((r1,g1,b1), (r2,g2,b2))``"
msgstr ""
"``color(colorstring1, colorstring2)``, ``color((r1,g1,b1), (r2,g2,b2))``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1030
msgid ""
"Equivalent to ``pencolor(colorstring1)`` and ``fillcolor(colorstring2)`` and "
"analogously if the other input format is used."
msgstr ""
"等同於 ``pencolor(colorstring1)`` 和 ``fillcolor(colorstring2)``，使用其他輸"
"入格式時也是類似的。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1033
msgid ""
"If the turtle shape is a polygon, the outline and interior of that polygon "
"are drawn with the newly set colors."
msgstr "如果海龜形狀是多邊形，該多邊形的輪廓和內部會以新設定的顏色繪製。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1036
msgid ""
">>> turtle.color(\"red\", \"green\")\n"
">>> turtle.color()\n"
"('red', 'green')\n"
">>> color(\"#285078\", \"#a0c8f0\")\n"
">>> color()\n"
"((40.0, 80.0, 120.0), (160.0, 200.0, 240.0))"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.color(\"red\", \"green\")\n"
">>> turtle.color()\n"
"('red', 'green')\n"
">>> color(\"#285078\", \"#a0c8f0\")\n"
">>> color()\n"
"((40.0, 80.0, 120.0), (160.0, 200.0, 240.0))"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1047
msgid "See also: Screen method :func:`colormode`."
msgstr "另請參閱：Screen 的 :func:`colormode` 方法。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1051
msgid "Filling"
msgstr "填色"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1062
msgid "Return ``True`` if the turtle is filling, ``False`` otherwise."
msgstr "如果海龜正在填色就回傳 ``True``，否則回傳 ``False``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1064
msgid ""
">>> turtle.begin_fill()\n"
">>> if turtle.filling():\n"
"...    turtle.pensize(5)\n"
"... else:\n"
"...    turtle.pensize(3)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.begin_fill()\n"
">>> if turtle.filling():\n"
"...    turtle.pensize(5)\n"
"... else:\n"
"...    turtle.pensize(3)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1076
msgid "Fill the shape drawn in the :keyword:`with` block."
msgstr "為在 :keyword:`with` 區塊中畫出的形狀填色。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1078
msgid ""
">>> turtle.color(\"black\", \"red\")\n"
">>> with turtle.fill():\n"
"...     turtle.circle(80)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.color(\"black\", \"red\")\n"
">>> with turtle.fill():\n"
"...     turtle.circle(80)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1085
msgid ""
":func:`fill` is a :term:`context manager`, so using it is the same as "
"calling :func:`begin_fill` before the block and :func:`end_fill` after it:"
msgstr ""
":func:`fill` 是一個\\ :term:`情境管理器 <context manager>`，因此使用它等同於"
"在區塊之前呼叫 :func:`begin_fill`，並在區塊之後呼叫 :func:`end_fill`："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1088 ../../library/turtle.rst:1114
msgid ""
">>> turtle.color(\"black\", \"red\")\n"
">>> turtle.begin_fill()\n"
">>> turtle.circle(80)\n"
">>> turtle.end_fill()"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.color(\"black\", \"red\")\n"
">>> turtle.begin_fill()\n"
">>> turtle.circle(80)\n"
">>> turtle.end_fill()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1101
msgid ""
"Call just before drawing a shape to be filled. The shape is filled by the "
"next call to :func:`end_fill`."
msgstr ""
"在即將畫出要填色的形狀之前呼叫。該形狀會在下一次呼叫 :func:`end_fill` 時填"
"色。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1107
msgid "Fill the shape drawn after the last call to :func:`begin_fill`."
msgstr "為上一次呼叫 :func:`begin_fill` 之後畫出的形狀填色。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1109
msgid ""
"If the shape crosses itself or several shapes overlap, whether the "
"overlapping parts are filled depends on the operating system, the type of "
"overlap and how many there are. For example, the turtle star above may be "
"either all yellow or have some white regions."
msgstr ""
"如果形狀與自身交叉，或多個形狀互相重疊，重疊的部分是否會被填色，取決於作業系"
"統、重疊的類型以及重疊的數量。例如，上面的海龜星形可能全部是黃色，也可能有一"
"些白色區域。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1124
msgid "More drawing control"
msgstr "更多繪圖控制"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1128
msgid ""
"Delete the turtle's drawings and re-center the turtle. The turtle's settings "
"are restored to their default values."
msgstr "刪除海龜的繪圖，並讓海龜回到中央。海龜的設定會還原為預設值。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1131
msgid ""
">>> turtle.goto(0,-22)\n"
">>> turtle.left(100)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-22.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"100.0\n"
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.goto(0,-22)\n"
">>> turtle.left(100)\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,-22.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"100.0\n"
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.position()\n"
"(0.00,0.00)\n"
">>> turtle.heading()\n"
"0.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1149
msgid ""
"Delete the turtle's drawings from the screen. The state and position of the "
"turtle as well as the drawings of other turtles are not affected."
msgstr ""
"從螢幕上刪除海龜的繪圖。海龜的狀態和位置，以及其他海龜的繪圖都不受影響。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1155
msgid "an object"
msgstr "一個物件"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1157 ../../library/turtle.rst:1856
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1965 ../../library/turtle.rst:1966
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1977 ../../library/turtle.rst:1978
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2075 ../../library/turtle.rst:2141
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2210 ../../library/turtle.rst:2266
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2605
msgid "a string"
msgstr "一個字串"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1158
msgid "a tuple of a string, an integer and a string"
msgstr "一個由字串、整數和字串組成的元組"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1160
msgid ""
"Write text at the current turtle position. The text is the string "
"representation of *arg*. *align* is one of the strings \"left\", \"center\" "
"or \"right\" and says how the text is placed relative to the turtle "
"position. *font* is a triple of font name, font size and font type. If "
"*move* is ``True``, the pen is moved to the bottom-right corner of the text."
msgstr ""
"在目前的海龜位置寫出文字。文字是 *arg* 的字串表示。*align* 是字串 \"left\"、"
"\"center\" 或 \"right\" 其中之一，表示文字相對於海龜位置的擺放方式。*font* 是"
"由字型名稱、字型大小和字型樣式組成的三元組。如果 *move* 為 ``True``，畫筆會移"
"動到文字的右下角。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1166
msgid ""
">>> turtle.write(\"Home = \", True, align=\"center\")\n"
">>> turtle.write((0,0), True)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.write(\"Home = \", True, align=\"center\")\n"
">>> turtle.write((0,0), True)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1174
msgid "Turtle state"
msgstr "海龜狀態"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1177
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "可見性"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1182
msgid "Make the turtle invisible. If the pen is down, movement still draws."
msgstr "讓海龜隱形。如果畫筆是放下的，移動時仍會畫線。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1188
msgid "Make the turtle visible."
msgstr "讓海龜顯示出來。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1193
msgid "Return ``True`` if the turtle is visible, ``False`` if it's hidden."
msgstr "如果海龜是可見的就回傳 ``True``，如果是隱藏的則回傳 ``False``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1195
msgid ""
">>> turtle.hideturtle()\n"
">>> turtle.isvisible()\n"
"False\n"
">>> turtle.showturtle()\n"
">>> turtle.isvisible()\n"
"True"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.hideturtle()\n"
">>> turtle.isvisible()\n"
"False\n"
">>> turtle.showturtle()\n"
">>> turtle.isvisible()\n"
"True"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1207
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外觀"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1211 ../../library/turtle.rst:1231
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1665 ../../library/turtle.rst:1880
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1999
msgid "a string or ``None``"
msgstr "一個字串或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1213
msgid ""
"Set the turtle shape to the named shape. If *name* is not given, return the "
"name of the current shape. The shape must exist in "
"the :class:`TurtleScreen`'s shape list. Initially there are the following "
"shapes: \"arrow\", \"turtle\", \"circle\", \"square\", \"triangle\" and "
"\"classic\". To add shapes, see the :class:`Screen` "
"method :func:`register_shape`."
msgstr ""
"將海龜形狀設為指定名稱的形狀。如果沒有給定 *name*，就回傳目前形狀的名稱。該形"
"狀必須存在於 :class:`TurtleScreen` 的形狀串列中。一開始有以下這些形狀："
"\"arrow\"、\"turtle\"、\"circle\"、\"square\"、\"triangle\" 和 \"classic\"。"
"要新增形狀，請參閱 :class:`Screen` 的 :func:`register_shape` 方法。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1219
msgid ""
">>> turtle.shape()\n"
"'classic'\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"turtle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shape()\n"
"'turtle'"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.shape()\n"
"'classic'\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"turtle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shape()\n"
"'turtle'"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1233
msgid ""
"Set the resizemode to \"auto\", \"user\" or \"noresize\". If *rmode* is not "
"given, return the current resizemode. The different resizemodes have the "
"following effects:"
msgstr ""
"將 resizemode 設為 \"auto\"、\"user\" 或 \"noresize\"。如果沒有給定 *rmode*，"
"就回傳目前的 resizemode。不同的 resizemode 有以下效果："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1237
msgid ""
"\"auto\": the turtle is resized according to the value of :func:`pensize`."
msgstr "\"auto\"：海龜會依照 :func:`pensize` 的值調整大小。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1238
msgid ""
"\"user\": the turtle is resized according to the stretch factors and outline "
"width, which are set by :func:`shapesize`."
msgstr ""
"\"user\"：海龜會依照由 :func:`shapesize` 設定的拉伸係數和輪廓寬度調整大小。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1240
msgid "\"noresize\": the turtle is not resized."
msgstr "\"noresize\"：海龜不會調整大小。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1242
msgid ""
"``resizemode(\"user\")`` is called by :func:`shapesize` when used with "
"arguments."
msgstr "帶引數使用 :func:`shapesize` 時，它會呼叫 ``resizemode(\"user\")``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1245
msgid ""
">>> turtle.resizemode()\n"
"'noresize'\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode(\"auto\")\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode()\n"
"'auto'"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.resizemode()\n"
"'noresize'\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode(\"auto\")\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode()\n"
"'auto'"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1262
msgid ""
"Return or set the turtle's stretch factors and outline width. If no "
"arguments are given, return the current values. Otherwise set resizemode to "
"\"user\", so that the turtle is displayed stretched according to its stretch "
"factors:"
msgstr ""
"回傳或設定海龜的拉伸係數和輪廓寬度。如果沒有給定引數，就回傳目前的值。否則將 "
"resizemode 設為 \"user\"，讓海龜依照它的拉伸係數伸展顯示："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1267
msgid "*stretch_wid*: the stretch factor perpendicular to the turtle's heading"
msgstr "*stretch_wid*：垂直於海龜朝向的拉伸係數"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1268
msgid ""
"*stretch_len*: the stretch factor in the direction of the turtle's heading"
msgstr "*stretch_len*：沿著海龜朝向的拉伸係數"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1270
msgid "*outline*: the width of the shape's outline"
msgstr "*outline*：形狀輪廓的寬度"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1272
msgid ""
"For example, ``shapesize(2, 1)`` makes the turtle twice as wide without "
"changing its length. If only *stretch_wid* is given, *stretch_len* is set to "
"the same value."
msgstr ""
"例如，``shapesize(2, 1)`` 會讓海龜的寬度變成兩倍，而不改變長度。如果只給定 "
"*stretch_wid*，*stretch_len* 會被設為相同的值。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1276
msgid ""
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(1.0, 1.0, 1)\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode(\"user\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5, 5, 12)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(5, 5, 12)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(outline=8)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(5, 5, 8)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(1.0, 1.0, 1)\n"
">>> turtle.resizemode(\"user\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5, 5, 12)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(5, 5, 12)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(outline=8)\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize()\n"
"(5, 5, 8)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1294
msgid ""
"Return or set the current shear factor. Shearing slants the turtle shape, "
"like the slant of italic letters. The shear factor says how much it is "
"slanted: 0 is not slanted at all, and the larger the number, the stronger "
"the slant. Negative numbers slant the other way. If *shear* is not given, "
"return the current shear factor. Otherwise slant the turtle shape "
"accordingly and set resizemode to \"user\". The turtle's heading does not "
"change. Precisely, the shear factor is the tangent of the shear angle."
msgstr ""
"回傳或設定目前的剪切係數。剪切會讓海龜形狀歪斜，就像斜體字母的歪斜一樣。剪切"
"係數表示歪斜的程度：0 表示完全不歪斜，數字越大，歪斜得越厲害。負數會往另一個"
"方向歪斜。如果沒有給定 *shear*，就回傳目前的剪切係數。否則依此讓海龜形狀歪"
"斜，並將 resizemode 設為 \"user\"。海龜的朝向不會改變。精確地說，剪切係數是剪"
"切角的正切值。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1302
msgid ""
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor(0.5)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor()\n"
"0.5"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor(0.5)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor()\n"
"0.5"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1316
msgid ""
"Turn the turtle shape by *angle* from its current tilt angle. The turtle's "
"heading does not change, so the turtle keeps moving in the same direction. "
"See :func:`tiltangle`."
msgstr ""
"將海龜形狀從目前的傾斜角度再旋轉 *angle*。海龜的朝向不會改變，因此海龜會繼續"
"朝相同的方向移動。請參閱 :func:`tiltangle`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1320
msgid ""
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(30)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(30)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(30)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(30)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1336
msgid ""
"Return or set the current tilt angle. The tilt angle is the angle between "
"the direction the turtle shape points in and the direction the turtle moves "
"in. Normally the shape points in the direction of movement, so the tilt "
"angle is 0. If *angle* is given, turn the turtle shape to that tilt angle, "
"no matter what it was before, and set resizemode to \"user\". The turtle's "
"heading does not change. If *angle* is not given, return the current tilt "
"angle."
msgstr ""
"回傳或設定目前的傾斜角度。傾斜角度是海龜形狀所指的方向與海龜移動方向之間的夾"
"角。通常形狀會指向移動的方向，因此傾斜角度為 0。如果給定 *angle*，就將海龜形"
"狀轉到該傾斜角度（無論之前是多少），並將 resizemode 設為 \"user\"。海龜的朝向"
"不會改變。如果沒有給定 *angle*，就回傳目前的傾斜角度。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1344
msgid ""
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(45)\n"
">>> turtle.tiltangle()\n"
"45.0"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.reset()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"circle\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(5,2)\n"
">>> turtle.tilt(45)\n"
">>> turtle.tiltangle()\n"
"45.0"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1362
msgid ""
"Return or set the transformation matrix of the turtle shape. The matrix "
"combines the stretch factors, the shear factor and the tilt angle of the "
"turtle shape into four numbers: *t11* and *t12* form its first row, *t21* "
"and *t22* its second. If none of them are given, return the current matrix "
"as a tuple of four numbers. Otherwise set the given elements and update the "
"stretch factors, shear factor and tilt angle accordingly. ``t11 * t22 - t12 "
"* t21`` must not be zero, otherwise an error is raised."
msgstr ""
"回傳或設定海龜形狀的變換矩陣。此矩陣將海龜形狀的拉伸係數、剪切係數和傾斜角度"
"合併成四個數字：*t11* 和 *t12* 構成第一列，*t21* 和 *t22* 構成第二列。如果都"
"沒有給定，就以四個數字組成的元組回傳目前的矩陣。否則設定給定的元素，並依此更"
"新拉伸係數、剪切係數和傾斜角度。``t11 * t22 - t12 * t21`` 不可為零，否則會引"
"發錯誤。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1370
msgid ""
">>> turtle = Turtle()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"square\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(4,2)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor(-0.5)\n"
">>> turtle.shapetransform()\n"
"(4.0, -1.0, -0.0, 2.0)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle = Turtle()\n"
">>> turtle.shape(\"square\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapesize(4,2)\n"
">>> turtle.shearfactor(-0.5)\n"
">>> turtle.shapetransform()\n"
"(4.0, -1.0, -0.0, 2.0)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1383
msgid ""
"Return the points that form the outline of the current turtle shape as a "
"tuple of ``(x, y)`` coordinate pairs. These points can be used to define a "
"new shape or parts of a :ref:`compound shape <compound-shapes>`."
msgstr ""
"回傳構成目前海龜形狀輪廓的各點，形式為由 ``(x, y)`` 座標對組成的元組。這些點"
"可用來定義新的形狀，或作為\\ :ref:`複合形狀 <compound-shapes>`\\ 的一部分。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1387
msgid ""
">>> turtle.shape(\"square\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapetransform(4, -1, 0, 2)\n"
">>> turtle.get_shapepoly()\n"
"((50, -20), (30, 20), (-50, 20), (-30, -20))"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.shape(\"square\")\n"
">>> turtle.shapetransform(4, -1, 0, 2)\n"
">>> turtle.get_shapepoly()\n"
"((50, -20), (30, 20), (-50, 20), (-30, -20))"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1397
msgid "Using events"
msgstr "使用事件"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1402 ../../library/turtle.rst:1425
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1453 ../../library/turtle.rst:1905
msgid "a function with two arguments or ``None``"
msgstr "一個有兩個引數的函式或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1404 ../../library/turtle.rst:1427
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1455 ../../library/turtle.rst:1907
msgid "a boolean or ``None``"
msgstr "一個布林值或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1406
msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to mouse-click events on this turtle. *fun* is called with the "
"coordinates of the clicked point on the canvas. If *fun* is ``None``, "
"existing bindings are removed. *btn* is the number of the mouse button and "
"defaults to 1, the left mouse button. If *add* is ``True``, a new binding is "
"added, otherwise it replaces a previous binding. Example for the anonymous "
"turtle, that is, the procedural way:"
msgstr ""
"將 *fun* 繫結到此海龜上的滑鼠點擊事件。呼叫 *fun* 時會傳入畫布上被點擊位置的"
"座標。如果 *fun* 為 ``None``，則移除既有的繫結。*btn* 是滑鼠按鍵的編號，預設"
"為 1，也就是滑鼠左鍵。如果 *add* 為 ``True``，會新增一個繫結，否則會取代先前"
"的繫結。以下是匿名海龜（也就是程序式寫法）的範例："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1413
msgid ""
">>> def turn(x, y):\n"
"...     left(180)\n"
"...\n"
">>> onclick(turn)  # Now clicking into the turtle will turn it.\n"
">>> onclick(None)  # event-binding will be removed"
msgstr ""
">>> def turn(x, y):\n"
"...     left(180)\n"
"...\n"
">>> onclick(turn)  # 現在點擊海龜會讓它轉向。\n"
">>> onclick(None)  # 事件繫結會被移除"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1429
msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to mouse-button-release events on this turtle. *fun* is called "
"with the coordinates of the point on the canvas where the mouse button is "
"released. If *fun* is ``None``, existing bindings are removed. *btn* is the "
"number of the mouse button and defaults to 1, the left mouse button. If "
"*add* is ``True``, a new binding is added, otherwise it replaces a previous "
"binding."
msgstr ""
"將 *fun* 繫結到此海龜上的放開滑鼠按鍵事件。呼叫 *fun* 時會傳入畫布上滑鼠按鍵"
"放開位置的座標。如果 *fun* 為 ``None``，則移除既有的繫結。*btn* 是滑鼠按鍵的"
"編號，預設為 1，也就是滑鼠左鍵。如果 *add* 為 ``True``，會新增一個繫結，否則"
"會取代先前的繫結。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1436
msgid ""
">>> class MyTurtle(Turtle):\n"
"...     def glow(self,x,y):\n"
"...         self.fillcolor(\"red\")\n"
"...\n"
"...     def unglow(self,x,y):\n"
"...         self.fillcolor(\"\")\n"
"...\n"
">>> turtle = MyTurtle()\n"
">>> turtle.onclick(turtle.glow)     # clicking on turtle turns fillcolor "
"red,\n"
">>> turtle.onrelease(turtle.unglow) # releasing turns it to transparent."
msgstr ""
">>> class MyTurtle(Turtle):\n"
"...     def glow(self,x,y):\n"
"...         self.fillcolor(\"red\")\n"
"...\n"
"...     def unglow(self,x,y):\n"
"...         self.fillcolor(\"\")\n"
"...\n"
">>> turtle = MyTurtle()\n"
">>> turtle.onclick(turtle.glow)     # 點擊海龜會讓填充顏色變成紅色，\n"
">>> turtle.onrelease(turtle.unglow) # 放開則會讓它變成透明。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1457
msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to mouse-move events on this turtle. *fun* is called with the "
"coordinates of the mouse pointer on the canvas. If *fun* is ``None``, "
"existing bindings are removed. *btn* is the number of the mouse button and "
"defaults to 1, the left mouse button. If *add* is ``True``, a new binding is "
"added, otherwise it replaces a previous binding. Every sequence of mouse-"
"move events on a turtle is preceded by a mouse-click event on that turtle."
msgstr ""
"將 *fun* 繫結到此海龜上的滑鼠移動事件。呼叫 *fun* 時會傳入畫布上滑鼠指標的座"
"標。如果 *fun* 為 ``None``，則移除既有的繫結。*btn* 是滑鼠按鍵的編號，預設為 "
"1，也就是滑鼠左鍵。如果 *add* 為 ``True``，會新增一個繫結，否則會取代先前的繫"
"結。在海龜上發生的每一連串滑鼠移動事件之前，都會先有一個在該海龜上的滑鼠點擊"
"事件。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1465
msgid ">>> turtle.ondrag(turtle.goto)"
msgstr ">>> turtle.ondrag(turtle.goto)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1470
msgid ""
"Clicking and dragging the turtle then moves it across the screen, drawing by "
"hand if the pen is down."
msgstr ""
"這樣一來，點擊並拖曳海龜就能讓它在螢幕上移動；如果畫筆是放下的，就能徒手作"
"畫。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1475
msgid "Special Turtle methods"
msgstr "特殊的 Turtle 方法"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1479
msgid ""
"Record the vertices of a polygon drawn in the :keyword:`with` block. The "
"first and last vertices will be connected."
msgstr ""
"記錄在 :keyword:`with` 區塊中畫出的多邊形頂點。第一個和最後一個頂點會被連接起"
"來。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1482
msgid ""
">>> with turtle.poly():\n"
"...     turtle.forward(100)\n"
"...     turtle.right(60)\n"
"...     turtle.forward(100)"
msgstr ""
">>> with turtle.poly():\n"
"...     turtle.forward(100)\n"
"...     turtle.right(60)\n"
"...     turtle.forward(100)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1490
msgid ""
":func:`poly` is a :term:`context manager`, so using it is the same as "
"calling :func:`begin_poly` before the block and :func:`end_poly` after it:"
msgstr ""
":func:`poly` 是一個\\ :term:`情境管理器 <context manager>`，因此使用它等同於"
"在區塊之前呼叫 :func:`begin_poly`，並在區塊之後呼叫 :func:`end_poly`："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1493
msgid ""
">>> turtle.begin_poly()\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> turtle.right(60)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> turtle.end_poly()"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.begin_poly()\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> turtle.right(60)\n"
">>> turtle.forward(100)\n"
">>> turtle.end_poly()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1507
msgid ""
"Start recording the vertices of a polygon. The current turtle position is "
"the first vertex of the polygon."
msgstr "開始記錄多邊形的頂點。目前的海龜位置是多邊形的第一個頂點。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1513
msgid ""
"Stop recording the vertices of a polygon. The current turtle position is the "
"last vertex of the polygon. This will be connected with the first vertex."
msgstr ""
"停止記錄多邊形的頂點。目前的海龜位置是多邊形的最後一個頂點，它會與第一個頂點"
"相連。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1519
msgid "Return the last recorded polygon."
msgstr "回傳最後記錄的多邊形。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1521
msgid ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.begin_poly()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(100)\n"
">>> turtle.left(20)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(30)\n"
">>> turtle.left(60)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.end_poly()\n"
">>> p = turtle.get_poly()\n"
">>> register_shape(\"myFavouriteShape\", p)"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.home()\n"
">>> turtle.begin_poly()\n"
">>> turtle.fd(100)\n"
">>> turtle.left(20)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(30)\n"
">>> turtle.left(60)\n"
">>> turtle.fd(50)\n"
">>> turtle.end_poly()\n"
">>> p = turtle.get_poly()\n"
">>> register_shape(\"myFavouriteShape\", p)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1538
msgid ""
"Create and return a clone of the turtle. The clone has the same position, "
"heading and turtle properties."
msgstr "建立並回傳海龜的複製品。複製品具有相同的位置、朝向和海龜屬性。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1541
msgid ""
">>> leonel = Turtle()\n"
">>> marco = leonel.clone()"
msgstr ""
">>> leonel = Turtle()\n"
">>> marco = leonel.clone()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1551
msgid "Return the Turtle object itself."
msgstr "回傳 Turtle 物件本身。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1553
msgid ""
"Call ``getturtle()`` to get the turtle used by functions such "
"as :func:`forward` and :func:`left`:"
msgstr ""
"呼叫 ``getturtle()`` 來取得 :func:`forward` 和 :func:`left` 等函式所使用的海"
"龜："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1556
msgid ""
">>> pet = getturtle()\n"
">>> pet.fd(50)\n"
">>> pet\n"
"<turtle.Turtle object at 0x...>"
msgstr ""
">>> pet = getturtle()\n"
">>> pet.fd(50)\n"
">>> pet\n"
"<turtle.Turtle object at 0x...>"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1567
msgid ""
"Return the :class:`TurtleScreen` object the turtle is drawing on. "
"TurtleScreen methods can then be called for that object."
msgstr ""
"回傳海龜正在其上繪圖的 :class:`TurtleScreen` 物件。接著就可以對該物件呼叫 "
"TurtleScreen 的方法。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1570
msgid ""
">>> ts = turtle.getscreen()\n"
">>> ts\n"
"<turtle._Screen object at 0x...>\n"
">>> ts.bgcolor(\"pink\")"
msgstr ""
">>> ts = turtle.getscreen()\n"
">>> ts\n"
"<turtle._Screen object at 0x...>\n"
">>> ts.bgcolor(\"pink\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1583
msgid ""
"Set or disable the undo buffer. If *size* is an integer, an empty undo "
"buffer of the given size is installed. *size* is the maximum number of "
"turtle actions that can be undone by :func:`undo`. If *size* is ``None``, "
"the undo buffer is disabled."
msgstr ""
"設定或停用復原緩衝區。如果 *size* 是整數，就會建立一個給定大小的空復原緩衝"
"區。*size* 是可以用 :func:`undo` 復原的海龜動作數量上限。如果 *size* 為 "
"``None``，就停用復原緩衝區。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1588
msgid ">>> turtle.setundobuffer(42)"
msgstr ">>> turtle.setundobuffer(42)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1596
msgid "Return the number of entries in the undo buffer."
msgstr "回傳復原緩衝區中的項目數量。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1598
msgid ""
">>> while turtle.undobufferentries():\n"
"...     turtle.undo()"
msgstr ""
">>> while turtle.undobufferentries():\n"
"...     turtle.undo()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1609
msgid "Screen methods and functions"
msgstr "Screen 的方法與函式"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1611
msgid ""
"Most of the examples in this section refer to a TurtleScreen instance called "
"``screen``."
msgstr "本節的大多數範例都是針對一個名為 ``screen`` 的 TurtleScreen 實例。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1622
msgid "Window control"
msgstr "視窗控制"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1628
msgid "Return or set the background color of the TurtleScreen."
msgstr "回傳或設定 TurtleScreen 的背景顏色。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1632
msgid "``bgcolor()``"
msgstr "``bgcolor()``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1633
msgid ""
"Return the current background color as a color specification string or as a "
"tuple (see example).  May be used as input to "
"another :func:`color`, :func:`pencolor`, :func:`fillcolor` "
"or :func:`bgcolor` call."
msgstr ""
"以顏色規格字串或元組的形式回傳目前的背景顏色（請參閱範例）。可作為另一"
"個 :func:`color`、:func:`pencolor`、:func:`fillcolor` 或 :func:`bgcolor` 呼叫"
"的輸入。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1638
msgid "``bgcolor(colorstring)``"
msgstr "``bgcolor(colorstring)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1639
msgid ""
"Set the background color to *colorstring*, which is a Tk color specification "
"string, such as ``\"red\"``, ``\"yellow\"``, or ``\"#33cc8c\"``."
msgstr ""
"將背景顏色設為 *colorstring*，它是一個 Tk 顏色規格字串，例如 ``\"red\"``、"
"``\"yellow\"`` 或 ``\"#33cc8c\"``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1642
msgid "``bgcolor((r, g, b))``"
msgstr "``bgcolor((r, g, b))``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1643
msgid ""
"Set the background color to the RGB color represented by the tuple of *r*, "
"*g*, and *b*. Each of *r*, *g*, and *b* must be between 0 and colormode, "
"where colormode is either 1.0 or 255 (see :func:`colormode`)."
msgstr ""
"將背景顏色設為由 *r*、*g* 和 *b* 組成的元組所表示的 RGB 顏色。*r*、*g* 和 "
"*b* 都必須介於 0 和 colormode 之間，其中 colormode 是 1.0 或 255（請參"
"閱 :func:`colormode`）。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1648
msgid "``bgcolor(r, g, b)``"
msgstr "``bgcolor(r, g, b)``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1649
msgid ""
"Set the background color to the RGB color represented by *r*, *g*, and *b*. "
"Each of *r*, *g*, and *b* must be between 0 and colormode."
msgstr ""
"將背景顏色設為由 *r*、*g* 和 *b* 所表示的 RGB 顏色。*r*、*g* 和 *b* 都必須介"
"於 0 和 colormode 之間。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1652
msgid ""
">>> screen.bgcolor(\"orange\")\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor()\n"
"'orange'\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor(\"#800080\")\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor()\n"
"(128.0, 0.0, 128.0)"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.bgcolor(\"orange\")\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor()\n"
"'orange'\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor(\"#800080\")\n"
">>> screen.bgcolor()\n"
"(128.0, 0.0, 128.0)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1667
msgid ""
"Set the background image or return the name of the current one. If *picname* "
"is the name of an image file (PNG, GIF, PGM, and PPM), set that image as the "
"background. If *picname* is ``\"nopic\"``, delete the background image, if "
"present. If *picname* is ``None``, return the filename of the current "
"background image. ::"
msgstr ""
"設定背景圖片，或回傳目前背景圖片的名稱。如果 *picname* 是圖片檔（PNG、GIF、"
"PGM 和 PPM）的名稱，就將該圖片設為背景。如果 *picname* 是 ``\"nopic\"``，就刪"
"除背景圖片（如果有的話）。如果 *picname* 為 ``None``，就回傳目前背景圖片的檔"
"名。 ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1673
msgid ""
">>> screen.bgpic()\n"
"'nopic'\n"
">>> screen.bgpic(\"landscape.gif\")\n"
">>> screen.bgpic()\n"
"'landscape.gif'"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.bgpic()\n"
"'nopic'\n"
">>> screen.bgpic(\"landscape.gif\")\n"
">>> screen.bgpic()\n"
"'landscape.gif'"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1684
msgid ""
"This TurtleScreen method is available as a global function only under the "
"name ``clearscreen``.  The global function ``clear`` is a different one "
"derived from the Turtle method ``clear``."
msgstr ""
"此 TurtleScreen 方法只能以 ``clearscreen`` 這個名稱作為全域函式使用。全域函"
"式 ``clear`` 是另一個衍生自 Turtle 方法 ``clear`` 的函式。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1691
msgid ""
"Delete all drawings and all turtles from the TurtleScreen.  Reset the now "
"empty TurtleScreen to its initial state: white background, no background "
"image, no event bindings and tracing on."
msgstr ""
"從 TurtleScreen 刪除所有繪圖和所有海龜。將現在已清空的 TurtleScreen 重設為初"
"始狀態：白色背景、沒有背景圖片、沒有事件繫結，且追蹤為開啟狀態。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1700
msgid ""
"This TurtleScreen method is available as a global function only under the "
"name ``resetscreen``.  The global function ``reset`` is another one derived "
"from the Turtle method ``reset``."
msgstr ""
"此 TurtleScreen 方法只能以 ``resetscreen`` 這個名稱作為全域函式使用。全域函"
"式 ``reset`` 是另一個衍生自 Turtle 方法 ``reset`` 的函式。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1707
msgid "Reset all turtles on the screen to their initial state."
msgstr "將螢幕上的所有海龜重設為初始狀態。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1714
msgid "a colorstring or ``None``"
msgstr "一個顏色字串或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1716
msgid ""
"Resize the canvas the turtles are drawing on. *canvwidth* and *canvheight* "
"are the new width and height of the canvas in pixels, and *bg* is the new "
"background color. If no arguments are given, return the current canvas width "
"and height."
msgstr ""
"調整海龜繪圖所用畫布的大小。*canvwidth* 和 *canvheight* 是畫布新的寬度和高度"
"（以像素為單位），*bg* 是新的背景顏色。如果沒有給定引數，就回傳目前畫布的寬度"
"和高度。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1721
msgid ""
"The drawing window is not altered. To see hidden parts of the canvas, use "
"the scrollbars. This can make visible those parts of a drawing which were "
"outside the canvas before, for example to find a turtle that has wandered "
"off the canvas."
msgstr ""
"繪圖視窗不會改變。要查看畫布中被隱藏的部分，請使用捲軸。這可以讓繪圖中原本位"
"於畫布之外的部分變得可見，例如用來找出一隻跑到畫布外的海龜。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1726
msgid ""
">>> screen.screensize()\n"
"(400, 300)\n"
">>> screen.screensize(2000,1500)\n"
">>> screen.screensize()\n"
"(2000, 1500)"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.screensize()\n"
"(400, 300)\n"
">>> screen.screensize(2000,1500)\n"
">>> screen.screensize()\n"
"(2000, 1500)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1743
msgid ""
"Set up a user-defined coordinate system. *llx* and *lly* are the x and y "
"coordinates of the lower left corner of the canvas. *urx* and *ury* are the "
"x and y coordinates of the upper right corner. Switch to mode \"world\" if "
"necessary, which performs a reset. If mode \"world\" is already active, all "
"drawings are redrawn according to the new coordinates. In user-defined "
"coordinate systems, angles may appear distorted, see :func:`mode`."
msgstr ""
"設定使用者定義的座標系統。*llx* 和 *lly* 是畫布左下角的 x 和 y 座標。*urx* "
"和 *ury* 是右上角的 x 和 y 座標。必要時會切換到 \"world\" 模式，這會執行一次"
"重設。如果 \"world\" 模式已經在使用中，所有繪圖都會依照新的座標重新繪製。在使"
"用者定義的座標系統中，角度可能會看起來變形，請參閱 :func:`mode`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1750
msgid ""
">>> screen.reset()\n"
">>> screen.setworldcoordinates(-50,-7.5,50,7.5)\n"
">>> for _ in range(72):\n"
"...     left(10)\n"
"...\n"
">>> for _ in range(8):\n"
"...     left(45); fd(2)   # a regular octagon"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.reset()\n"
">>> screen.setworldcoordinates(-50,-7.5,50,7.5)\n"
">>> for _ in range(72):\n"
"...     left(10)\n"
"...\n"
">>> for _ in range(8):\n"
"...     left(45); fd(2)   # 一個正八邊形"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1771
msgid "Animation control"
msgstr "動畫控制"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1775
msgid ""
"Temporarily turn off turtle animation. The code inside the :keyword:`with` "
"block is not animated. Once the block is exited, the drawing appears. This "
"is useful for drawing complex shapes where even the fastest speed setting is "
"too slow."
msgstr ""
"暫時關閉海龜動畫。:keyword:`with` 區塊內的程式碼不會有動畫。離開區塊後，繪圖"
"就會出現。繪製連最快速度設定都嫌太慢的複雜形狀時，這會很有用。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1780
msgid ""
">>> with screen.no_animation():\n"
"...     for dist in range(2, 400, 2):\n"
"...         fd(dist)\n"
"...         rt(90)"
msgstr ""
">>> with screen.no_animation():\n"
"...     for dist in range(2, 400, 2):\n"
"...         fd(dist)\n"
"...         rt(90)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1793 ../../library/turtle.rst:1811
#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1812
msgid "a nonnegative integer or ``None``"
msgstr "一個非負整數或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1795
msgid ""
"Return or set the drawing delay in milliseconds. This is approximately the "
"time interval between two consecutive canvas updates. The longer the drawing "
"delay, the slower the animation."
msgstr ""
"回傳或設定繪圖延遲（以毫秒為單位）。這大約是兩次連續畫布更新之間的時間間隔。"
"繪圖延遲越長，動畫就越慢。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1799
msgid ""
">>> screen.delay()\n"
"10\n"
">>> screen.delay(5)\n"
">>> screen.delay()\n"
"5"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.delay()\n"
"10\n"
">>> screen.delay(5)\n"
">>> screen.delay()\n"
"5"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1814
msgid ""
"Turn turtle animation on or off and set the drawing delay. If *n* is given, "
"only every n-th regular screen update is performed, which can be used to "
"speed up the drawing of complex graphics. If *n* is 0, animation is turned "
"off and the screen is only updated by calling :func:`update`. If *delay* is "
"given, it sets the drawing delay, see :func:`delay`. When called without "
"arguments, return the current value of *n*."
msgstr ""
"開啟或關閉海龜動畫，並設定繪圖延遲。如果給定 *n*，每 n 次一般螢幕更新只會實際"
"執行一次，這可以用來加速複雜圖形的繪製。如果 *n* 為 0，就會關閉動畫，且只有在"
"呼叫 :func:`update` 時才會更新螢幕。如果給定 *delay*，它會設定繪圖延遲，請參"
"閱 :func:`delay`。在沒有引數的情況下呼叫時，回傳目前 *n* 的值。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1821
msgid ""
">>> screen.tracer(8, 25)\n"
">>> dist = 2\n"
">>> for i in range(200):\n"
"...     fd(dist)\n"
"...     rt(90)\n"
"...     dist += 2"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.tracer(8, 25)\n"
">>> dist = 2\n"
">>> for i in range(200):\n"
"...     fd(dist)\n"
"...     rt(90)\n"
"...     dist += 2"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1834
msgid ""
"Perform a TurtleScreen update. To be used when :func:`tracer` is turned off."
msgstr "執行一次 TurtleScreen 更新。在 :func:`tracer` 關閉時使用。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1836
msgid "See also the RawTurtle/Turtle method :func:`speed`."
msgstr "另請參閱 RawTurtle/Turtle 的 :func:`speed` 方法。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1840
msgid "Using screen events"
msgstr "使用螢幕事件"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1844 ../../library/turtle.rst:1845
msgid "ignored"
msgstr "會被忽略"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1847
msgid ""
"Set focus on the :class:`TurtleScreen` so that it receives key events. The "
"two dummy arguments are only there so that :func:`listen` can be passed "
"to :func:`onclick`."
msgstr ""
"將焦點設定在 :class:`TurtleScreen` 上，讓它能接收按鍵事件。那兩個虛設引數只是"
"為了讓 :func:`listen` 能被傳給 :func:`onclick`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1855 ../../library/turtle.rst:1879
msgid "a function with no arguments or ``None``"
msgstr "一個沒有引數的函式或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1858
msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to the key-release event of *key*. *key* is a key, such as \"a\", "
"or a key symbol, such as \"space\". If *fun* is ``None``, the event binding "
"is removed. To be able to receive key events, the :class:`TurtleScreen` must "
"have focus, see :func:`listen`."
msgstr ""
"將 *fun* 繫結到 *key* 的放開按鍵事件。*key* 是一個按鍵（例如 \"a\"）或按鍵符"
"號（例如 \"space\"）。如果 *fun* 為 ``None``，就移除該事件繫結。要能接收按鍵"
"事件，:class:`TurtleScreen` 必須取得焦點，請參閱 :func:`listen`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1863
msgid ""
">>> def f():\n"
"...     fd(50)\n"
"...     lt(60)\n"
"...\n"
">>> screen.onkey(f, \"Up\")\n"
">>> screen.listen()"
msgstr ""
">>> def f():\n"
"...     fd(50)\n"
"...     lt(60)\n"
"...\n"
">>> screen.onkey(f, \"Up\")\n"
">>> screen.listen()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1873
msgid ""
"The turtle can then be moved by repeatedly pressing the up-arrow key, "
"drawing a hexagon."
msgstr "接著就可以重複按下向上方向鍵來移動海龜，畫出一個六邊形。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1882
msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to the key-press event of *key*. *key* is a key, such as \"a\", "
"or a key symbol, such as \"space\". If *key* is not given, *fun* is bound to "
"the key-press event of any key. If *fun* is ``None``, the event binding is "
"removed. To be able to receive key events, the :class:`TurtleScreen` must "
"have focus, see :func:`listen`."
msgstr ""
"將 *fun* 繫結到 *key* 的按下按鍵事件。*key* 是一個按鍵（例如 \"a\"）或按鍵符"
"號（例如 \"space\"）。如果沒有給定 *key*，*fun* 會被繫結到任何按鍵的按下按鍵"
"事件。如果 *fun* 為 ``None``，就移除該事件繫結。要能接收按鍵事"
"件，:class:`TurtleScreen` 必須取得焦點，請參閱 :func:`listen`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1888
msgid ""
">>> def f():\n"
"...     fd(50)\n"
"...     lt(60)\n"
"...\n"
">>> screen.onkeypress(f, \"Up\")\n"
">>> screen.listen()"
msgstr ""
">>> def f():\n"
"...     fd(50)\n"
"...     lt(60)\n"
"...\n"
">>> screen.onkeypress(f, \"Up\")\n"
">>> screen.listen()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1898
msgid ""
"The turtle can then be moved by pressing or holding down the up-arrow key, "
"drawing a hexagon."
msgstr "接著就可以按下或按住向上方向鍵來移動海龜，畫出一個六邊形。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1909
msgid ""
"Bind *fun* to mouse-click events on this screen. *fun* is called with the "
"coordinates of the clicked point on the canvas. If *fun* is ``None``, "
"existing bindings are removed. *btn* is the number of the mouse button and "
"defaults to 1, the left mouse button. If *add* is ``True``, a new binding is "
"added, otherwise it replaces a previous binding."
msgstr ""
"將 *fun* 繫結到此螢幕上的滑鼠點擊事件。呼叫 *fun* 時會傳入畫布上被點擊位置的"
"座標。如果 *fun* 為 ``None``，則移除既有的繫結。*btn* 是滑鼠按鍵的編號，預設"
"為 1，也就是滑鼠左鍵。如果 *add* 為 ``True``，會新增一個繫結，否則會取代先前"
"的繫結。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1915
msgid ""
"Example for a TurtleScreen instance named ``screen`` and a Turtle instance "
"named ``turtle``:"
msgstr ""
"以下範例使用名為 ``screen`` 的 TurtleScreen 實例與名為 ``turtle`` 的 Turtle "
"實例："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1918
msgid ""
">>> screen.onclick(turtle.goto) # Subsequently clicking into the "
"TurtleScreen will\n"
">>>                             # make the turtle move to the clicked "
"point.\n"
">>> screen.onclick(None)        # remove event binding again"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.onclick(turtle.goto) # 之後點擊 TurtleScreen 時，\n"
">>>                             # 海龜就會移動到被點擊的位置。\n"
">>> screen.onclick(None)        # 再次移除事件繫結"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1926
msgid ""
"This TurtleScreen method is available as a global function only under the "
"name ``onscreenclick``.  The global function ``onclick`` is another one "
"derived from the Turtle method ``onclick``."
msgstr ""
"此 TurtleScreen 方法只能以 ``onscreenclick`` 這個名稱作為全域函式使用。全域函"
"式 ``onclick`` 是另一個衍生自 Turtle 方法 ``onclick`` 的函式。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1933
msgid "a function with no arguments"
msgstr "一個沒有引數的函式"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1934
msgid "a nonnegative number"
msgstr "一個非負數"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1936
msgid "Install a timer that calls *fun* after *t* milliseconds."
msgstr "設定一個計時器，在 *t* 毫秒後呼叫 *fun*。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1938
msgid ""
">>> running = True\n"
">>> def f():\n"
"...     if running:\n"
"...         fd(50)\n"
"...         lt(60)\n"
"...         screen.ontimer(f, 250)\n"
">>> f()  # makes the turtle march around\n"
">>> running = False"
msgstr ""
">>> running = True\n"
">>> def f():\n"
"...     if running:\n"
"...         fd(50)\n"
"...         lt(60)\n"
"...         screen.ontimer(f, 250)\n"
">>> f()  # 讓海龜不停地繞圈前進\n"
">>> running = False"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1954
msgid ""
"Start the event loop by calling Tkinter's :meth:`~tkinter.Misc.mainloop` "
"method. Must be the last statement in a turtle graphics program. Must *not* "
"be used if a script is run from within IDLE in -n mode (see :ref:`idle-no-"
"subprocess`)."
msgstr ""
"呼叫 Tkinter 的 :meth:`~tkinter.Misc.mainloop` 方法來啟動事件迴圈。這必須是海"
"龜繪圖程式中的最後一個陳述式。如果腳本是在 IDLE 中以 -n 模式執行，則\\ *不可"
"*\\ 使用（請參閱\\ :ref:`idle-no-subprocess`）。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1961
msgid "Input methods"
msgstr "輸入方法"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1968
msgid ""
"Pop up a dialog window for input of a string. *title* is the title of the "
"dialog window and *prompt* is a text describing what information to input. "
"Return the string entered. If the dialog is canceled, return ``None``. ::"
msgstr ""
"彈出一個用來輸入字串的對話視窗。*title* 是對話視窗的標題，*prompt* 是描述要輸"
"入什麼資訊的文字。回傳輸入的字串。如果對話視窗被取消，則回傳 ``None``。 ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1972
msgid ">>> screen.textinput(\"NIM\", \"Name of first player:\")"
msgstr ">>> screen.textinput(\"NIM\", \"Name of first player:\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1983
msgid ""
"Pop up a dialog window for input of a number. *title* is the title of the "
"dialog window and *prompt* is a text describing what numerical information "
"to input. *default* is the default value, *minval* and *maxval* are the "
"minimum and maximum values for input. If these are given and the number "
"entered is not between *minval* and *maxval*, a hint is issued and the "
"dialog remains open for correction. Return the number entered. If the dialog "
"is canceled, return ``None``. ::"
msgstr ""
"彈出一個用來輸入數字的對話視窗。*title* 是對話視窗的標題，*prompt* 是描述要輸"
"入什麼數值資訊的文字。*default* 是預設值，*minval* 和 *maxval* 是輸入的最小值"
"與最大值。如果有給定這兩個值，而輸入的數字不在 *minval* 與 *maxval* 之間，就"
"會顯示提示，並讓對話視窗保持開啟以便修正。回傳輸入的數字。如果對話視窗被取"
"消，則回傳 ``None``。 ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1991
msgid ""
">>> screen.numinput(\"Poker\", \"Your stakes:\", 1000, minval=10, "
"maxval=10000)"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.numinput(\"Poker\", \"Your stakes:\", 1000, minval=10, "
"maxval=10000)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:1995
msgid "Settings and special methods"
msgstr "設定與特殊方法"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2001
msgid ""
"Set the turtle mode and perform a reset. *mode* is one of the strings "
"\"standard\", \"logo\" or \"world\". If *mode* is not given, return the "
"current mode."
msgstr ""
"設定海龜模式並執行重設。*mode* 是字串 \"standard\"、\"logo\" 或 \"world\" 其"
"中之一。如果沒有給定 *mode*，則回傳目前的模式。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2005
msgid ""
"Mode \"standard\" is compatible with the old :mod:`!turtle` module. Mode "
"\"logo\" is compatible with most Logo turtle graphics. Mode \"world\" uses "
"user-defined world coordinates, see :func:`setworldcoordinates`. In this "
"mode, angles appear distorted if the x and y units are not of equal length."
msgstr ""
"\"standard\" 模式與舊的 :mod:`!turtle` 模組相容。\"logo\" 模式與大多數 Logo "
"海龜繪圖相容。\"world\" 模式採用使用者定義的世界座標，請參"
"閱 :func:`setworldcoordinates`。在此模式下，如果 x 和 y 的單位長度不相等，角"
"度看起來會變形。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2011
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2011
msgid "Initial turtle heading"
msgstr "海龜的初始朝向"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2011
msgid "positive angles"
msgstr "正角度方向"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2013
msgid "\"standard\""
msgstr "\"standard\""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2013
msgid "to the right (east)"
msgstr "向右（東）"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2013
msgid "counterclockwise"
msgstr "逆時針"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2014
msgid "\"logo\""
msgstr "\"logo\""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2014
msgid "upward    (north)"
msgstr "向上（北）"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2014
msgid "clockwise"
msgstr "順時針"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2017
msgid ""
">>> mode(\"logo\")  # resets turtle heading to north\n"
">>> mode()\n"
"'logo'"
msgstr ""
">>> mode(\"logo\")  # 將海龜的朝向重設為北方\n"
">>> mode()\n"
"'logo'"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2029
msgid ""
"Return the colormode or set it to 1.0 or 255. After setting it, the *r*, *g* "
"and *b* values of color triples have to be between 0 and *cmode*."
msgstr ""
"回傳 colormode，或將其設為 1.0 或 255。設定之後，顏色三元組的 *r*、*g*、*b* "
"值都必須介於 0 到 *cmode* 之間。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2032
msgid ""
">>> screen.colormode(1)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(240, 160, 80)\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"     ...\n"
"turtle.TurtleGraphicsError: bad color sequence: (240, 160, 80)\n"
">>> screen.colormode()\n"
"1.0\n"
">>> screen.colormode(255)\n"
">>> screen.colormode()\n"
"255\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(240,160,80)"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.colormode(1)\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(240, 160, 80)\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"     ...\n"
"turtle.TurtleGraphicsError: bad color sequence: (240, 160, 80)\n"
">>> screen.colormode()\n"
"1.0\n"
">>> screen.colormode(255)\n"
">>> screen.colormode()\n"
"255\n"
">>> turtle.pencolor(240,160,80)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2050
msgid ""
"Return the Canvas of this TurtleScreen.  Useful for insiders who know what "
"to do with a Tkinter Canvas."
msgstr ""
"回傳此 TurtleScreen 的 Canvas。對於知道如何運用 Tkinter Canvas 的內行人很有"
"用。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2053
msgid ""
">>> cv = screen.getcanvas()\n"
">>> cv\n"
"<turtle.ScrolledCanvas object ...>"
msgstr ""
">>> cv = screen.getcanvas()\n"
">>> cv\n"
"<turtle.ScrolledCanvas object ...>"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2063
msgid "Return a list of names of all currently available turtle shapes."
msgstr "回傳目前所有可用海龜形狀的名稱串列。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2065
msgid ""
">>> screen.getshapes()\n"
"['arrow', 'blank', 'circle', ..., 'turtle']"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.getshapes()\n"
"['arrow', 'blank', 'circle', ..., 'turtle']"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2076
msgid ""
"a string, a tuple of pairs of numbers, a :class:`Shape` object or ``None``"
msgstr "一個字串、一個由數字對組成的元組、一個 :class:`Shape` 物件或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2079
msgid ""
"Add a turtle shape to the TurtleScreen's shape list. It can be called in "
"four different ways:"
msgstr "將一個海龜形狀加入 TurtleScreen 的形狀串列。有四種不同的呼叫方式："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2082
msgid ""
"*name* is the name of an image file (PNG, GIF, PGM, and PPM) and *shape* is "
"``None``: Install the corresponding image shape. ::"
msgstr ""
"*name* 是圖片檔（PNG、GIF、PGM 和 PPM）的名稱，且 *shape* 為 ``None``：加入對"
"應的圖片形狀。 ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2085
msgid ">>> screen.register_shape(\"turtle.gif\")"
msgstr ">>> screen.register_shape(\"turtle.gif\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2087
msgid ""
"*name* is an arbitrary string and *shape* is the name of an image file (PNG, "
"GIF, PGM, and PPM): Install the corresponding image shape. ::"
msgstr ""
"*name* 是任意字串，*shape* 是圖片檔（PNG、GIF、PGM 和 PPM）的名稱：加入對應的"
"圖片形狀。 ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2090
msgid ">>> screen.register_shape(\"turtle\", \"turtle.gif\")"
msgstr ">>> screen.register_shape(\"turtle\", \"turtle.gif\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2092
msgid ""
"*name* is an arbitrary string and *shape* is a tuple of pairs of "
"coordinates: Install the corresponding polygon shape."
msgstr ""
"*name* 是任意字串，*shape* 是由座標對組成的元組：加入對應的多邊形形狀。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2095
msgid ">>> screen.register_shape(\"triangle\", ((5,-3), (0,5), (-5,-3)))"
msgstr ">>> screen.register_shape(\"triangle\", ((5,-3), (0,5), (-5,-3)))"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2100
msgid ""
"*name* is an arbitrary string and *shape* is a (compound) :class:`Shape` "
"object: Install the corresponding compound shape."
msgstr ""
"*name* 是任意字串，*shape* 是一個（複合的）\\ :class:`Shape` 物件：加入對應的"
"複合形狀。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2103
msgid ""
"Image shapes do not rotate when turning the turtle, so they do not display "
"the heading of the turtle. To use a registered shape, call :func:`shape` "
"with its name."
msgstr ""
"圖片形狀在海龜轉向時不會跟著旋轉，因此不會顯示海龜的朝向。要使用已註冊的形"
"狀，請以該形狀的名稱呼叫 :func:`shape`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2107
msgid ""
"Added support for PNG, PGM, and PPM image formats. Both a shape name and an "
"image file name can be specified."
msgstr ""
"新增對 PNG、PGM 和 PPM 圖片格式的支援。可以同時指定形狀名稱和圖片檔名。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2114
msgid "Return the list of turtles on the screen."
msgstr "回傳螢幕上的海龜串列。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2116
msgid ""
">>> for turtle in screen.turtles():\n"
"...     turtle.color(\"red\")"
msgstr ""
">>> for turtle in screen.turtles():\n"
"...     turtle.color(\"red\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2125
msgid "Return the height of the turtle window. ::"
msgstr "回傳海龜視窗的高度。 ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2127
msgid ""
">>> screen.window_height()\n"
"480"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.window_height()\n"
"480"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2133
msgid "Return the width of the turtle window. ::"
msgstr "回傳海龜視窗的寬度。 ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2135
msgid ""
">>> screen.window_width()\n"
"640"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.window_width()\n"
"640"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2144
msgid ""
"Save the current drawing and the turtles as a PostScript file. *filename* is "
"the path of the file to create. It must end with ``\".ps\"`` or "
"``\".eps\"``. If a file with that name already exists, "
"a :exc:`FileExistsError` is raised, unless *overwrite* is ``True``. "
"*overwrite* must be given by name, as in ``overwrite=True``."
msgstr ""
"將目前的繪圖和海龜存成 PostScript 檔案。*filename* 是要建立的檔案路徑，必須"
"以 ``\".ps\"`` 或 ``\".eps\"`` 結尾。如果已存在同名檔案，除非 *overwrite* 為 "
"``True``，否則會引發 :exc:`FileExistsError`。*overwrite* 必須以關鍵字引數的形"
"式給定，例如 ``overwrite=True``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2150
msgid ""
">>> screen.save(\"my_drawing.ps\")\n"
">>> screen.save(\"my_drawing.ps\", overwrite=True)"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.save(\"my_drawing.ps\")\n"
">>> screen.save(\"my_drawing.ps\", overwrite=True)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2163
msgid "Screen-only methods"
msgstr "僅限 Screen 的方法"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2167
msgid "Close the turtle graphics window."
msgstr "關閉海龜繪圖視窗。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2172
msgid ""
"Bind :func:`bye` to mouse clicks on the screen and start the event loop. "
"Clicking on the screen then closes the turtle graphics window. If the "
"configuration value ``using_IDLE`` is ``True``, the event loop is not "
"started, see :func:`mainloop`."
msgstr ""
"將 :func:`bye` 繫結到螢幕上的滑鼠點擊事件，並啟動事件迴圈。之後點擊螢幕就會關"
"閉海龜繪圖視窗。如果設定值 ``using_IDLE`` 為 ``True``，則不會啟動事件迴圈，請"
"參閱 :func:`mainloop`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2180 ../../library/turtle.rst:2181
msgid "an integer or a float"
msgstr "一個整數或浮點數"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2185
msgid "Set the size and position of the main window."
msgstr "設定主視窗的大小與位置。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2187
msgid ""
"*width* and *height* are the size of the window. As integers they are sizes "
"in pixels, as floats they are fractions of the screen, so 0.5 is half the "
"screen. The defaults are 50% of the screen width and 75% of its height."
msgstr ""
"*width* 和 *height* 是視窗的大小。若為整數，表示以像素為單位的大小；若為浮點"
"數，表示佔螢幕的比例，因此 0.5 代表螢幕的一半。預設值為螢幕寬度的 50% 及螢幕"
"高度的 75%。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2191
msgid ""
"*startx* and *starty* are the position of the window. If positive, they are "
"the distance in pixels from the left and top edges of the screen, if "
"negative from the right and bottom edges. If ``None``, the window is "
"centered in that direction."
msgstr ""
"*startx* 和 *starty* 是視窗的位置。若為正數，表示與螢幕左邊緣及上邊緣相距的像"
"素數；若為負數，則是與右邊緣及下邊緣的距離。若為 ``None``，視窗會在該方向上置"
"中。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2196
msgid ""
"The default values of all arguments are stored in the configuration "
"dictionary and can be changed with a :file:`turtle.cfg` file."
msgstr ""
"所有引數的預設值都儲存在設定字典中，可以透過 :file:`turtle.cfg` 檔案更改。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2199
msgid ""
">>> screen.setup(width=200, height=200, startx=0, starty=0)\n"
">>> # sets window to 200x200 pixels, in upper left of screen\n"
">>> screen.setup(width=0.75, height=0.5)\n"
">>> # sets window to 75% of screen by 50% of screen and centers"
msgstr ""
">>> screen.setup(width=200, height=200, startx=0, starty=0)\n"
">>> # 將視窗設為 200x200 像素，位於螢幕左上角\n"
">>> screen.setup(width=0.75, height=0.5)\n"
">>> # 將視窗寬度設為螢幕的 75%、高度設為螢幕的 50%，並置中"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2212
msgid ""
"Set the title of the turtle window to *titlestring*. The title is shown in "
"the title bar of the turtle graphics window."
msgstr ""
"將海龜視窗的標題設為 *titlestring*。標題會顯示在海龜繪圖視窗的標題列上。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2215
msgid ">>> screen.title(\"Welcome to the turtle zoo!\")"
msgstr ">>> screen.title(\"Welcome to the turtle zoo!\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2222
msgid "Public classes"
msgstr "公開類別"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2227
msgid ""
"a :class:`!tkinter.Canvas`, a :class:`ScrolledCanvas` or "
"a :class:`TurtleScreen`"
msgstr ""
"一個 :class:`!tkinter.Canvas`、:class:`ScrolledCanvas` "
"或 :class:`TurtleScreen`"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2230
msgid ""
"Create a turtle. The turtle has all the methods described in :ref:`turtle-"
"methods`."
msgstr "建立一隻海龜。這隻海龜擁有 :ref:`turtle-methods`\\ 中描述的所有方法。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2236
msgid ""
"Subclass of RawTurtle, has the same interface but draws on a "
"default :class:`Screen` object created automatically when needed for the "
"first time."
msgstr ""
"RawTurtle 的子類別，具有相同的介面，但會在一個預設的 :class:`Screen` 物件上繪"
"圖，該物件會在第一次需要時自動建立。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2242
msgid "a :class:`!tkinter.Canvas`"
msgstr "一個 :class:`!tkinter.Canvas`"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2244
msgid ""
"Provides the screen-oriented methods, such as :func:`bgcolor`, that are "
"described above."
msgstr "提供前面所述的螢幕相關方法，例如 :func:`bgcolor`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2250
msgid ""
"Subclass of :class:`TurtleScreen`, with :ref:`four methods added "
"<screenspecific>`. Calling ``Screen()`` returns the single screen object. If "
"it does not exist yet, it is created. Otherwise the existing one is returned."
msgstr ""
":class:`TurtleScreen` 的子類別，並\\ :ref:`新增了四個方法 <screenspecific>`。"
"呼叫 ``Screen()`` 會回傳唯一的螢幕物件。如果該物件還不存在，就會建立它；否則"
"回傳既有的物件。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2258
msgid "a Tkinter widget"
msgstr "一個 Tkinter 元件"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2260
msgid ""
"A Tkinter canvas with scrollbars added. *master* is the widget that contains "
"it. Used by class :class:`Screen`, which thus automatically provides a "
"ScrolledCanvas as playground for the turtles."
msgstr ""
"加上捲軸的 Tkinter 畫布。*master* 是包含它的元件。由 :class:`Screen` 類別使"
"用，因此 Screen 會自動提供一個 ScrolledCanvas 作為海龜們的遊樂場。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2267
msgid "depends on *type_*"
msgstr "取決於 *type_*"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2269
msgid ""
"Data structure modeling shapes. *type_* is one of the strings \"polygon\", "
"\"image\" or \"compound\". What *data* must be depends on *type_*: for "
"\"polygon\" a tuple of pairs of coordinates, for \"image\" an image (only "
"used internally), and for \"compound\" ``None``, as a compound shape is "
"built up using the :meth:`addcomponent` method."
msgstr ""
"用來表示形狀的資料結構。*type_* 是字串 \"polygon\"、\"image\" 或 "
"\"compound\" 其中之一。*data* 必須是什麼取決於 *type_*：若為 \"polygon\"，則"
"是由座標對組成的元組；若為 \"image\"，則是一張圖片（僅供內部使用）；若為 "
"\"compound\"，則為 ``None``，因為複合形狀是透過 :meth:`addcomponent` 方法逐步"
"建構的。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2277
msgid "a tuple of pairs of numbers"
msgstr "一個由數字對組成的元組"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2278
msgid "a color"
msgstr "一個顏色"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2279
msgid "a color or ``None``"
msgstr "一個顏色或 ``None``"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2281
msgid ""
"Add a component to a shape of type \"compound\". *poly* is a polygon, a "
"tuple of pairs of numbers. *fill* is the color the polygon is filled with "
"and *outline* is the color of its outline. If *outline* is not given, *fill* "
"is used for it as well."
msgstr ""
"為種類為 \"compound\" 的形狀加入一個元件。*poly* 是一個多邊形，也就是由數字對"
"組成的元組。*fill* 是用來為該多邊形填色的顏色，*outline* 是其輪廓的顏色。如果"
"沒有給定 *outline*，則輪廓也會使用 *fill* 的顏色。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2286
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "例如："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2288
msgid ""
">>> poly = ((0,0), (10,-5), (0,10), (-10,-5))\n"
">>> s = Shape(\"compound\")\n"
">>> s.addcomponent(poly, \"red\", \"blue\")\n"
">>> # ... add more components and then use register_shape()"
msgstr ""
">>> poly = ((0,0), (10,-5), (0,10), (-10,-5))\n"
">>> s = Shape(\"compound\")\n"
">>> s.addcomponent(poly, \"red\", \"blue\")\n"
">>> # ... 加入更多元件，然後使用 register_shape()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2296
msgid "See :ref:`compoundshapes`."
msgstr "請見\\ :ref:`compoundshapes`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2301
msgid ""
"A two-dimensional vector class, used as a helper class for implementing "
"turtle graphics.  May be useful for turtle graphics programs too.  Derived "
"from tuple, so a vector is a tuple!"
msgstr ""
"一個二維向量類別，用來作為實作海龜繪圖的輔助類別。也可能對海龜繪圖程式有用。"
"它衍生自元組 (tuple)，所以向量就是一個元組！"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2305
msgid "Provides (for *a*, *b* vectors, *k* number):"
msgstr "提供以下運算（*a*、*b* 為向量，*k* 為數字）："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2307
msgid "``a + b`` vector addition"
msgstr "``a + b`` 向量加法"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2308
msgid "``a - b`` vector subtraction"
msgstr "``a - b`` 向量減法"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2309
msgid "``a * b`` inner product"
msgstr "``a * b`` 內積"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2310
msgid "``k * a`` and ``a * k`` multiplication with scalar"
msgstr "``k * a`` 和 ``a * k`` 與純量相乘"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2311
msgid "``abs(a)`` absolute value of a"
msgstr "``abs(a)`` a 的絕對值"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2312
msgid "``a.rotate(angle)`` rotation"
msgstr "``a.rotate(angle)`` 旋轉"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2316
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "例外"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2318
msgid "The :mod:`!turtle` module defines the following exception:"
msgstr ":mod:`!turtle` 模組定義了以下例外："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2322
msgid ""
"Raised for invalid arguments or operations. For example, a malformed color "
"string:"
msgstr "在引數或操作無效時引發。例如，格式錯誤的顏色字串："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2325
msgid ""
">>> turtle.color(\"blau\")\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"    ...\n"
"turtle.TurtleGraphicsError: bad color string: blau"
msgstr ""
">>> turtle.color(\"blau\")\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"    ...\n"
"turtle.TurtleGraphicsError: bad color string: blau"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2339
msgid "How-to guides"
msgstr "操作指南"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2341
msgid "This section covers some typical turtle use-cases and approaches."
msgstr "本節介紹一些典型的海龜使用情境與做法。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2347
msgid "How to automatically begin and end filling"
msgstr "如何自動開始與結束填色"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2349
msgid ""
"Starting with Python 3.14, you can use the :func:`fill` :term:`context "
"manager` instead of :func:`begin_fill` and :func:`end_fill` to automatically "
"begin and end fill. Here is an example::"
msgstr ""
"從 Python 3.14 開始，你可以使用 :func:`fill` :term:`情境管理器 <context "
"manager>`\\ 來取代 :func:`begin_fill` 與 :func:`end_fill`，以自動開始與結束填"
"色。以下是一個範例： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2353
msgid ""
"with fill():\n"
"    for i in range(4):\n"
"        forward(100)\n"
"        right(90)\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"
msgstr ""
"with fill():\n"
"    for i in range(4):\n"
"        forward(100)\n"
"        right(90)\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2360
msgid "The code above is equivalent to::"
msgstr "上面的程式碼等同於： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2362
msgid ""
"begin_fill()\n"
"for i in range(4):\n"
"    forward(100)\n"
"    right(90)\n"
"end_fill()\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"
msgstr ""
"begin_fill()\n"
"for i in range(4):\n"
"    forward(100)\n"
"    right(90)\n"
"end_fill()\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2375
msgid "How to use compound shapes"
msgstr "如何使用複合形狀"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2377
msgid ""
"To use compound turtle shapes, which consist of several polygons of "
"different color, you must use the helper class :class:`Shape` explicitly as "
"described below:"
msgstr ""
"若要使用由多個不同顏色的多邊形組成的複合海龜形狀，你必須如下所述明確地使用輔"
"助類別 :class:`Shape`："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2381
msgid "Create an empty :class:`Shape` object of type \"compound\"."
msgstr "建立一個種類為 \"compound\" 的空 :class:`Shape` 物件。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2382
msgid ""
"Add as many components to this object as desired, using "
"the :meth:`~Shape.addcomponent` method."
msgstr "使用 :meth:`~Shape.addcomponent` 方法，為此物件加入任意數量的元件。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2385
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "舉例來說："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2387
msgid ""
">>> s = Shape(\"compound\")\n"
">>> poly1 = ((0,0), (10,-5), (0,10), (-10,-5))\n"
">>> s.addcomponent(poly1, \"red\", \"blue\")\n"
">>> poly2 = ((0,0), (10,-5), (-10,-5))\n"
">>> s.addcomponent(poly2, \"blue\", \"red\")"
msgstr ""
">>> s = Shape(\"compound\")\n"
">>> poly1 = ((0,0), (10,-5), (0,10), (-10,-5))\n"
">>> s.addcomponent(poly1, \"red\", \"blue\")\n"
">>> poly2 = ((0,0), (10,-5), (-10,-5))\n"
">>> s.addcomponent(poly2, \"blue\", \"red\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2396
msgid "Now add the Shape to the Screen's shape list and use it:"
msgstr "接著將此 Shape 加入 Screen 的形狀串列並使用它："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2398
msgid ""
">>> register_shape(\"myshape\", s)\n"
">>> shape(\"myshape\")"
msgstr ""
">>> register_shape(\"myshape\", s)\n"
">>> shape(\"myshape\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2408
msgid "How to use the ``turtle`` module namespace"
msgstr "如何使用 ``turtle`` 模組命名空間"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2410
msgid ""
"Using ``from turtle import *`` is convenient - but be warned that it imports "
"a rather large collection of objects, and if you're doing anything but "
"turtle graphics you run the risk of a name conflict (this becomes even more "
"an issue if you're using turtle graphics in a script where other modules "
"might be imported)."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``from turtle import *`` 很方便，但要注意它會引入相當多的物件。如果你除"
"了海龜繪圖之外還在做其他事情，就會有名稱衝突的風險（如果你在可能還會引入其他"
"模組的腳本中使用海龜繪圖，這個問題會更加明顯）。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2416
msgid ""
"The solution is to use ``import turtle`` - ``fd()`` becomes ``turtle.fd()``, "
"``width()`` becomes ``turtle.width()`` and so on. (If typing \"turtle\" over "
"and over again becomes tedious, use for example ``import turtle as t`` "
"instead.)"
msgstr ""
"解決方法是使用 ``import turtle``：``fd()`` 會變成 ``turtle.fd()``、"
"``width()`` 會變成 ``turtle.width()``，依此類推。（如果一再輸入 \"turtle\" 讓"
"你覺得很繁瑣，可以改用例如 ``import turtle as t``。）"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2425
msgid "How to use turtle graphics in a script"
msgstr "如何在腳本中使用海龜繪圖"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2427
msgid ""
"It's recommended to use the ``turtle`` module namespace as described "
"immediately above, for example::"
msgstr "建議如上一節所述使用 ``turtle`` 模組命名空間，例如： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2430
msgid ""
"import turtle as t\n"
"from random import random\n"
"\n"
"for i in range(100):\n"
"    steps = int(random() * 100)\n"
"    angle = int(random() * 360)\n"
"    t.right(angle)\n"
"    t.fd(steps)"
msgstr ""
"import turtle as t\n"
"from random import random\n"
"\n"
"for i in range(100):\n"
"    steps = int(random() * 100)\n"
"    angle = int(random() * 360)\n"
"    t.right(angle)\n"
"    t.fd(steps)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2439
msgid ""
"Another step is also required though - as soon as the script ends, Python "
"will also close the turtle's window. Add::"
msgstr ""
"不過還需要另一個步驟：腳本一結束，Python 就會一併關閉海龜的視窗。請在腳本的結"
"尾加上： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2442
msgid "t.mainloop()"
msgstr "t.mainloop()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2444
msgid ""
"to the end of the script. The script will now wait to be dismissed and will "
"not exit until it is terminated, for example by closing the turtle graphics "
"window."
msgstr ""
"這樣一來，腳本就會等待被關閉，在被終止之前（例如關閉海龜繪圖視窗）都不會結"
"束。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2452
msgid "How to use object-oriented turtle graphics"
msgstr "如何使用物件導向的海龜繪圖"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2454
msgid ""
":ref:`Explanation of the object-oriented interface <turtle-explanation>`"
msgstr ":ref:`物件導向介面的解釋 <turtle-explanation>`"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2456
msgid ""
"Other than for very basic introductory purposes, or for trying things out as "
"quickly as possible, it's more usual and much more powerful to use the "
"object-oriented approach to turtle graphics. For example, this allows "
"multiple turtles on screen at once."
msgstr ""
"除了非常基本的入門用途，或想要盡快試試看之外，以物件導向的方式來使用海龜繪圖"
"會更常見，功能也強大得多。例如，這可以讓螢幕上同時有多隻海龜。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2461
msgid ""
"In this approach, the various turtle commands are methods of objects (mostly "
"of ``Turtle`` objects). You *can* use the object-oriented approach in the "
"shell, but it would be more typical in a Python script."
msgstr ""
"在這種方式中，各種海龜指令都是物件（大多是 ``Turtle`` 物件）的方法。你\\ *可"
"以*\\ 在 shell 中使用物件導向的方式，但在 Python 腳本中使用會更為典型。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2465
msgid "The example above then becomes::"
msgstr "上面的範例就會變成： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2467
msgid ""
"from turtle import Turtle\n"
"from random import random\n"
"\n"
"t = Turtle()\n"
"for i in range(100):\n"
"    steps = int(random() * 100)\n"
"    angle = int(random() * 360)\n"
"    t.right(angle)\n"
"    t.fd(steps)\n"
"\n"
"t.screen.mainloop()"
msgstr ""
"from turtle import Turtle\n"
"from random import random\n"
"\n"
"t = Turtle()\n"
"for i in range(100):\n"
"    steps = int(random() * 100)\n"
"    angle = int(random() * 360)\n"
"    t.right(angle)\n"
"    t.fd(steps)\n"
"\n"
"t.screen.mainloop()"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2479
msgid ""
"Note the last line. ``t.screen`` is an instance of the :class:`Screen` that "
"a Turtle instance exists on; it's created automatically along with the "
"turtle."
msgstr ""
"注意最後一行。``t.screen`` 是該 Turtle 實例所在之 :class:`Screen` 的實例；它"
"會與海龜一起自動建立。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2483
msgid "The turtle's screen can be customised, for example::"
msgstr "海龜的螢幕可以自訂，例如： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2485
msgid ""
"t.screen.title('Object-oriented turtle demo')\n"
"t.screen.bgcolor(\"orange\")"
msgstr ""
"t.screen.title('Object-oriented turtle demo')\n"
"t.screen.bgcolor(\"orange\")"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2492
msgid "How to use :func:`!help`"
msgstr "如何使用 :func:`!help`"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2494
msgid ""
"The public methods of the Screen and Turtle classes are documented "
"extensively via docstrings.  So these can be used as online-help via the "
"Python help facilities:"
msgstr ""
"Screen 和 Turtle 類別的公開方法都透過說明字串提供了詳盡的文件，因此可以透過 "
"Python 的說明工具作為線上說明使用："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2498
msgid ""
"When using IDLE, tooltips show the signatures and first lines of the "
"docstrings of typed in function/method calls."
msgstr ""
"使用 IDLE 時，在輸入函式或方法呼叫後，工具提示會顯示其簽名以及說明字串的前幾"
"行。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2501
msgid "Calling :func:`help` on methods or functions displays the docstrings::"
msgstr "對方法或函式呼叫 :func:`help` 會顯示其說明字串： ::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2503
msgid ""
">>> help(TurtleScreen.bgcolor)\n"
"Help on function bgcolor in module turtle:\n"
"\n"
"bgcolor(self, *args)\n"
"    Return or set the background color of the TurtleScreen.\n"
"\n"
"    Four input formats are allowed:\n"
"      - bgcolor()\n"
"        Return the current background color as a color specification\n"
"        string or as a tuple (see example).  May be used as input\n"
"        to another color(), pencolor(), fillcolor() or bgcolor() call.\n"
"      - bgcolor(colorstring)\n"
"        Set the background color to colorstring, which is a Tk color\n"
"        specification string, such as \"red\", \"yellow\", or \"#33cc8c\".\n"
"      - bgcolor((r, g, b))\n"
"        Set the background color to the RGB color represented by\n"
"        the tuple of r, g, and b.  Each of r, g, and b must be\n"
"        between 0 and colormode, where colormode is either 1.0 or 255\n"
"        (see colormode()).\n"
"      - bgcolor(r, g, b)\n"
"        Set the background color to the RGB color represented by\n"
"        r, g, and b.  Each of r, g, and b must be between 0 and\n"
"        colormode.\n"
"\n"
"    Example (for a TurtleScreen instance named screen):\n"
"        >>> screen.bgcolor(\"orange\")\n"
"        >>> screen.bgcolor()\n"
"        'orange'\n"
"        >>> screen.colormode(255)\n"
"        >>> screen.bgcolor(\"#800080\")\n"
"        >>> screen.bgcolor()\n"
"        (128.0, 0.0, 128.0)\n"
"\n"
">>> help(Turtle.penup)\n"
"Help on function penup in module turtle:\n"
"\n"
"penup(self)\n"
"    Lift the pen.\n"
"\n"
"    Aliases: penup | pu | up\n"
"\n"
"    The turtle does not draw when it moves."
msgstr ""
