#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2592
msgid ""
"These modified docstrings are created automatically together with the "
"function definitions that are derived from the methods at import time."
msgstr "這些修改過的說明字串，會在引入時與衍生自方法的函式定義一起自動建立。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2597
msgid "Translation of docstrings into different languages"
msgstr "將說明字串翻譯成不同語言"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2599
msgid ""
"There is a utility to create a dictionary the keys of which are the method "
"names and the values of which are the docstrings of the public methods of "
"the classes Screen and Turtle."
msgstr ""
"有一個工具可以建立一個字典，其鍵為方法名稱，值為 Screen 和 Turtle 類別中公開"
"方法的說明字串。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2607
msgid ""
"Write the docstring dictionary to a Python script. The dictionary is written "
"to the file :file:`{filename}.py`. It is intended to serve as a template for "
"translating the docstrings into different languages. This function has to be "
"called explicitly. It is not used by the turtle graphics classes."
msgstr ""
"將說明字串字典寫入一個 Python 腳本。字典會被寫入檔案 :file:`{filename}.py`。"
"它的用途是作為將說明字串翻譯成不同語言的範本。這個函式必須明確地呼叫，海龜繪"
"圖的類別並不會使用它。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2612
msgid ""
"If you (or your students) want to use :mod:`!turtle` with online help in "
"your native language, you have to translate the docstrings and save the "
"resulting file as, for example, :file:`turtle_docstringdict_german.py`."
msgstr ""
"如果你（或你的學生）想要搭配母語的線上說明來使用 :mod:`!turtle`，你必須翻譯說"
"明字串，並將產生的檔案儲存為例如 :file:`turtle_docstringdict_german.py`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2616
msgid ""
"If you have an appropriate entry in your :file:`turtle.cfg` file this "
"dictionary will be read in at import time and will replace the original "
"English docstrings."
msgstr ""
"如果你的 :file:`turtle.cfg` 檔案中有適當的條目，這個字典就會在引入時被讀入，"
"並取代原本的英文說明字串。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2619
msgid ""
"At the time of this writing there are docstring dictionaries in German and "
"in Italian.  (Requests please to glingl@aon.at.)"
msgstr ""
"在撰寫本文時，已有德文和義大利文的說明字串字典。（如有需要，請寄信至 "
"glingl@aon.at。）"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2625
msgid "How to configure Screen and Turtles"
msgstr "如何設定 Screen 與海龜"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2627
msgid ""
"The built-in default configuration mimics the appearance and behaviour of "
"the old turtle module in order to retain best possible compatibility with it."
msgstr "內建的預設設定模仿舊 turtle 模組的外觀與行為，以盡可能保持與其相容。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2630
msgid ""
"If you want to use a different configuration which better reflects the "
"features of this module or which better fits to your needs, for example for "
"use in a classroom, you can prepare a configuration file ``turtle.cfg`` "
"which will be read at import time and modify the configuration according to "
"its settings."
msgstr ""
"如果你想使用不同的設定，以更能反映此模組的功能或更符合你的需求（例如在教室中"
"使用），你可以準備一個設定檔 ``turtle.cfg``，它會在引入時被讀取，並依照其中的"
"內容修改設定。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2635
msgid ""
"The built-in configuration would correspond to the following ``turtle.cfg``:"
msgstr "內建的設定相當於以下的 ``turtle.cfg``："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2637
msgid ""
"width = 0.5\n"
"height = 0.75\n"
"leftright = None\n"
"topbottom = None\n"
"canvwidth = 400\n"
"canvheight = 300\n"
"mode = standard\n"
"colormode = 1.0\n"
"delay = 10\n"
"undobuffersize = 1000\n"
"shape = classic\n"
"pencolor = black\n"
"fillcolor = black\n"
"resizemode = noresize\n"
"visible = True\n"
"language = english\n"
"exampleturtle = turtle\n"
"examplescreen = screen\n"
"title = Python Turtle Graphics\n"
"using_IDLE = False"
msgstr ""
"width = 0.5\n"
"height = 0.75\n"
"leftright = None\n"
"topbottom = None\n"
"canvwidth = 400\n"
"canvheight = 300\n"
"mode = standard\n"
"colormode = 1.0\n"
"delay = 10\n"
"undobuffersize = 1000\n"
"shape = classic\n"
"pencolor = black\n"
"fillcolor = black\n"
"resizemode = noresize\n"
"visible = True\n"
"language = english\n"
"exampleturtle = turtle\n"
"examplescreen = screen\n"
"title = Python Turtle Graphics\n"
"using_IDLE = False"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2660
msgid "Short explanation of selected entries:"
msgstr "部分條目的簡短說明："

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2662
msgid ""
"The first four lines correspond to the arguments of the :func:`Screen.setup "
"<setup>` method."
msgstr "前四行對應 :func:`Screen.setup <setup>` 方法的引數。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2664
msgid ""
"Line 5 and 6 correspond to the arguments of the "
"method :func:`Screen.screensize <screensize>`."
msgstr "第 5 和第 6 行對應 :func:`Screen.screensize <screensize>` 方法的引數。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2666
msgid ""
"*shape* can be any of the built-in shapes, such as arrow or turtle. For more "
"information, see :func:`shape`."
msgstr ""
"*shape* 可以是任何內建形狀，例如 arrow 或 turtle。更多資訊請參"
"閱 :func:`shape`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2668
msgid ""
"If you want to use no fill color (that is, make the turtle transparent), you "
"have to write ``fillcolor = \"\"`` (but all nonempty strings must not have "
"quotes in the cfg file)."
msgstr ""
"如果你不想使用填充顏色（也就是讓海龜透明），你必須寫 ``fillcolor = \"\"``\\ "
"（但在 cfg 檔案中，所有非空字串都不可以加上引號）。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2671
msgid ""
"If you want the turtle's appearance to reflect its state, you have to set "
"``resizemode = auto``."
msgstr "如果你希望海龜的外觀反映其狀態，你必須設定 ``resizemode = auto``。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2673
msgid ""
"If you set, for example, ``language = italian`` the "
"docstringdict :file:`turtle_docstringdict_italian.py` will be loaded at "
"import time (if present on the import path, for example, in the same "
"directory as :mod:`!turtle`)."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果你設定 ``language = italian``，說明字串字"
"典 :file:`turtle_docstringdict_italian.py` 就會在引入時被載入（如果它存在於引"
"入路徑上，例如與 :mod:`!turtle` 位於同一目錄中）。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2676
msgid ""
"The entries *exampleturtle* and *examplescreen* define the names of these "
"objects as they occur in the docstrings.  The transformation of method-"
"docstrings to function-docstrings will delete these names from the "
"docstrings."
msgstr ""
"*exampleturtle* 和 *examplescreen* 這兩個條目定義了這些物件在說明字串中出現時"
"的名稱。將方法說明字串轉換為函式說明字串時，會從說明字串中刪除這些名稱。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2680
msgid ""
"*using_IDLE*: Set this to ``True`` if you regularly work with IDLE and its "
"``-n`` switch (\"no subprocess\").  This will prevent :func:`exitonclick` "
"from entering the mainloop."
msgstr ""
"*using_IDLE*：如果你經常使用 IDLE 及其 ``-n`` 選項（「no subprocess」，即不使"
"用子行程），請將此設為 ``True``。這會防止 :func:`exitonclick` 進入主迴圈。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2684
msgid ""
"There can be a :file:`turtle.cfg` file in the directory where :mod:`!turtle` "
"is stored and an additional one in the current working directory.  The "
"latter will override the settings of the first one."
msgstr ""
":mod:`!turtle` 所在的目錄中可以有一個 :file:`turtle.cfg` 檔案，目前的工作目錄"
"中也可以再有一個。後者會覆寫前者的設定。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2688
msgid ""
"The :file:`Lib/turtledemo` directory contains a :file:`turtle.cfg` file.  "
"You can study it as an example and see its effects when running the demos "
"(preferably not from within the demo-viewer)."
msgstr ""
":file:`Lib/turtledemo` 目錄中有一個 :file:`turtle.cfg` 檔案。你可以把它當作範"
"例來研究，並在執行示範腳本時觀察其效果（最好不要從示範檢視器中執行）。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2696
msgid "Explanation"
msgstr "解釋"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2698
msgid ""
"A turtle object draws on a screen object, and there are a number of key "
"classes in the turtle object-oriented interface that can be used to create "
"them and relate them to each other."
msgstr ""
"海龜物件會在螢幕物件上繪圖，而海龜的物件導向介面中有幾個關鍵類別，可以用來建"
"立這些物件並將它們彼此關聯。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2702
msgid ""
"A :class:`Turtle` instance will automatically create a :class:`Screen` "
"instance if one is not already present."
msgstr "如果還沒有 :class:`Screen` 實例，:class:`Turtle` 實例會自動建立一個。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2705
msgid ""
"``Turtle`` is a subclass of :class:`RawTurtle`, which *doesn't* "
"automatically create a drawing surface - a *canvas* will need to be provided "
"or created for it. The *canvas* can be a :class:`!"
"tkinter.Canvas`, :class:`ScrolledCanvas` or :class:`TurtleScreen`."
msgstr ""
"``Turtle`` 是 :class:`RawTurtle` 的子類別，而後者\\ *不會*\\ 自動建立繪圖表"
"面，必須為它提供或建立一個 *canvas*。*canvas* 可以是 :class:`!"
"tkinter.Canvas`、:class:`ScrolledCanvas` 或 :class:`TurtleScreen`。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2711
msgid ""
":class:`TurtleScreen` is the basic drawing surface for a "
"turtle. :class:`Screen` is a subclass of ``TurtleScreen``, and "
"includes :ref:`some additional methods <screenspecific>` for managing its "
"appearance (including size and title) and behaviour. ``TurtleScreen``'s "
"constructor needs a :class:`!tkinter.Canvas` or a :class:`ScrolledCanvas` as "
"an argument."
msgstr ""
":class:`TurtleScreen` 是海龜的基本繪圖表面。:class:`Screen` 是 "
"``TurtleScreen`` 的子類別，並包含\\ :ref:`一些額外的方法 <screenspecific>`，"
"可用來管理其外觀（包括大小和標題）與行為。``TurtleScreen`` 的建構函式需要一"
"個 :class:`!tkinter.Canvas` 或 :class:`ScrolledCanvas` 作為引數。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2718
msgid ""
"The functional interface for turtle graphics uses the various methods of "
"``Turtle`` and ``TurtleScreen``/``Screen``. Behind the scenes, a screen "
"object is automatically created whenever a function derived from a "
"``Screen`` method is called. Similarly, a turtle object is automatically "
"created whenever any of the functions derived from a Turtle method is called."
msgstr ""
"海龜繪圖的函式介面使用了 ``Turtle`` 和 ``TurtleScreen``/``Screen`` 的各種方"
"法。在幕後，每當呼叫衍生自 ``Screen`` 方法的函式時，就會自動建立一個螢幕物"
"件。同樣地，每當呼叫任何衍生自 Turtle 方法的函式時，就會自動建立一個海龜物"
"件。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2724
msgid ""
"To use multiple turtles on a screen, the object-oriented interface must be "
"used."
msgstr "若要在一個螢幕上使用多隻海龜，就必須使用物件導向介面。"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2729
